#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Write pantoken's agent assets for a tool into a consumer repo."
msgstr "將 pantoken 的 agent 資產寫入消費者倉庫（針對某個工具）。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A specific [AgentTool](../type-aliases/AgentTool.md), or `\"all\"` for every asset."
msgstr "特定的 [AgentTool](../type-aliases/AgentTool.md)，或用 `\"all\"` 表示每個資產。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`)."
msgstr "目標目錄（預設 `\".\"`）。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written."
msgstr "已寫入的路徑。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/isScaffoldPlatform.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether `platform` is a known [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md) or one of its aliases (e.g. `html`)."
msgstr "判斷 `platform` 是否為已知的 [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)，或是否為其別名之一（例如 `html`）。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), and install pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) into the same directory."
msgstr "為某平台搭建起始專案（透過 `@pantoken/scaffold`），並將 pantoken 的代理資產（透過 [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)）安裝到相同目錄。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."
msgstr "一個 [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the scaffold's template files."
msgstr "目標目錄（預設 `\".\"`）。其基名（或針對 `\".\"` 使用 `\"pantoken-app\"`）\n  會在樣板的範本檔中取代為 `{{projectName}}`。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which agent tool's assets to install alongside the scaffold (default `\"all\"`)."
msgstr "要和樣板一併安裝的代理工具資產（預設 `\"all\"`）。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written, scaffold files first."
msgstr "已寫入的路徑，樣板檔案先列。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter with every agent asset installed**"
msgstr "**為 React 建立起始專案並安裝所有代理資產**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "為某平台搭建起始專案，已預先安裝並整合 pantoken。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "目標目錄（預設 `\".\"`）。其檔名基底（或在 `\".\"` 中使用 `\"pantoken-app\"`）會取代範本檔案中的 `{{projectName}}`。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform. `locale` (default `\"en\"`) sets the generated markup's\n  `lang`/`dir` attributes."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` 選擇要 `@pantoken/css` 代幣表單樣板檔案\n  匯入（預設 `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`)），應用於所有平台。 `cdn` 選擇 CDN\n  供應商 `canvas-theme-editor` 的 `theme.css`/`theme.js` 為其建立（預設 jsDelivr)；\n 被其他平台忽略。 `locale`（預設 `\"en\"`) 設定產生的標記的\n  `lang`/`dir` 屬性。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter**"
msgstr "**搭建 React 起始專案**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/ai` — consumer-facing agent assets for projects that *use* pantoken (not for\ndeveloping pantoken itself)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/ai` — 面向使用 pantoken 的專案的消費者端代理資產（不是用於\n開發 pantoken 本身）。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships an `AGENTS.md`, an `llms.txt`, editor/agent rule files (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), and\nClaude Code skills (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), plus [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / the `pantoken-ai` CLI to drop them into a consumer repo at the\nconventional paths."
msgstr "它提供一個 `AGENTS.md`、一個 `llms.txt`、編輯器/代理規則檔（Cursor、Copilot、Windsurf），以及\nClaude Code 技能（`init-pantoken`、`create-pantoken-app`），還有 [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / the `pantoken-ai` CLI，可將它們放入消費者倉庫的\n慣例路徑。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Asset content and the writer function now live in `@pantoken/scaffold` (so the base scaffold\nflow can offer them without a circular dependency); re-exported here for back-compat."
msgstr "資產內容和寫入函數現在位於 `@pantoken/scaffold`（因此基礎 scaffold\nflow 可以在不產生循環依賴的情況下提供它們); 在此重新匯出以維持向後相容。）"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/type-aliases/AgentTool.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An agent/editor tool pantoken can install assets for."
msgstr "pantoken 可為其安裝資產的代理/編輯器工具。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A platform pantoken can scaffold a starter project for."
msgstr "pantoken 可以為其建立一個入門專案的平台。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/variables/AGENTS_MD.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `AGENTS.md` content (consumer usage guide)."
msgstr "`AGENTS.md` 的內容（消費者使用指南）。"

