#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/variables/SCAFFOLD_PLATFORMS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every scaffoldable platform key (discovered from available presets, plus any legacy\ntemplate-only platforms not yet backed by a preset)."
msgstr "每個可用於腳手架的平臺鍵（從可用的預設中發現，外加任何尚未由預設支援的舊有\n僅範本平臺）。"

