#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Transpile extra InstUI packages**"
msgstr "**轉譯額外的 InstUI 套件**"

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/next` — a Next.js config adapter."
msgstr "`@pantoken/next` — 一個 Next.js 設定轉接器。"

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure UI ships ESM packages that Next must transpile (`transpilePackages`), the #1 papercut\nwhen running InstUI on Next. `withPantoken` merges the InstUI packages into that list. Wrap your\n`next.config`, then import `@pantoken/css` in your root layout for the tokens."
msgstr "Instructure UI 發行的是需要 Next 轉譯的 ESM 套件（`transpilePackages`），這是在 Next 上執行 InstUI 時最常遇到的麻煩。\n`withPantoken` 將 InstUI 套件合併到該清單中。包裹你的 `next.config`，然後在根布局中匯入 `@pantoken/css` 以取得 tokens。"

#: bundlers/next/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [withPantoken](functions/withPantoken.md)"

