#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A minimal Next config shape (only the field this adapter touches)."
msgstr "一個最小化的 Next 設定結構（僅包含此適配器所觸及的欄位）。"

#: bundlers/next/src/interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [withPantoken](../functions/withPantoken.md)."
msgstr "針對 [withPantoken](../functions/withPantoken.md) 的選項。"

#: bundlers/next/src/interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra package names to add to `transpilePackages`."
msgstr "要加入 `transpilePackages` 的額外套件名稱。"

#: bundlers/next/src/variables/INSTUI_TRANSPILE_PACKAGES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Instructure UI packages Next needs to transpile. Extend via [WithPantokenOptions](../interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md)."
msgstr "Next 需要轉譯的 Instructure UI 套件。透過 [WithPantokenOptions](../interfaces/WithPantokenOptions.md) 擴充。"

#: bundlers/next/src/variables/INSTUI_TRANSPILE_PACKAGES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Feed the list into a manual transpilePackages**"
msgstr "**將此清單輸入到手動的 transpilePackages**"

