msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/postcss` — a PostCSS plugin that expands an `@pantoken;` at-rule into the full\nInstructure token stylesheet (`@property` registrations + declarations). Write `@pantoken;` where\nyou want the tokens defined, and the plugin replaces it at build time."
msgstr "`@pantoken/postcss` — 一個 PostCSS 外掛，會將 `@pantoken;` at-rule 展開成完整的\nInstructure 代幣樣式表（`@property` 註冊 + 聲明）。在想要定義代幣的地方寫入 `@pantoken;`，外掛會在建置時替換它。"

