#: bundlers/tailwind/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/tailwind` — a Tailwind CSS preset that maps Instructure design tokens into the theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/tailwind` — 一個 Tailwind CSS 預設套件，將 Instructure 的設計代幣映射到主題。"

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every token is exposed as a `var(--instui-*)` reference (not a concrete value), so Tailwind\nutilities like `bg-color-background-base` theme through the same CSS custom properties that\n`@pantoken/css` emits — light/dark and high-contrast all keep working."
msgstr "每個代幣都以 `var(--instui-*)` 參照暴露（不是具體值），所以 Tailwind\n像 `bg-color-background-base` 這類的實用工具會透過與 `@pantoken/css` 輸出相同的 CSS 自訂屬性來套用主題 — 明/暗模式與高對比度皆能正常運作。"

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenPreset](functions/pantokenPreset.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [pantokenPreset](functions/pantokenPreset.md)"

#: bundlers/tailwind/src/interfaces/PantokenPresetOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
