msgstr "**在應用程式程式碼中使用虛擬模組**"

#: bundlers/vite/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vite` — a Vite plugin for pantoken."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vite` — 為 pantoken 提供的 Vite 外掛。"

#: bundlers/vite/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It exposes two virtual modules so apps consume tokens without importing the large packages\ndirectly, and can auto-inject the stylesheet into the HTML entry:"
msgstr "它暴露兩個虛擬模組，讓應用程式可以在不直接匯入大型套件的情況下使用 tokens，並能自動將樣式表注入到 HTML 入口："

#: bundlers/vite/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `virtual:pantoken/css` — the stylesheet string (default export).\n- `virtual:pantoken/tokens` — the resolved token IR (`tokens` named + default export)."
msgstr "- `virtual:pantoken/css` — 樣式表字串（預設匯出）。\n- `virtual:pantoken/tokens` — 已解析的 token IR（`tokens` 命名 + 預設匯出）。"

#: bundlers/vite/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantoken](functions/pantoken.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [pantoken](functions/pantoken.md)"

#: bundlers/vite/src/interfaces/PantokenViteOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the [pantoken](../functions/pantoken.md) Vite plugin."
msgstr "為 [pantoken](../functions/pantoken.md) 的 Vite 外掛選項。"

#: bundlers/vite/src/interfaces/PantokenViteOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inject the stylesheet into the HTML entry's `<head>` (default: false)."
msgstr "Inject the stylesheet into the HTML entry's `&lt;head&gt;` (default: false)."

