#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-alert` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "`.instui-alert` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — 一則帶有狀態色條與來自共用圖示集的遮罩狀態圖示的內嵌訊息。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A custom `-icon-<name>` swaps the status glyph but keeps the variant's coloured bar; the bar fill is re-asserted at higher specificity so the shared icon painter doesn't consume it. A direct close button defaults to small; add a size modifier to override it."
msgstr "自訂的 `-icon-<name>` 會替換狀態圖示，但保留該變體的彩色色條；色條填充在更高特異性下會被重新指定，因此共用圖示繪製器不會覆蓋它。直接的關閉按鈕預設為 small；加入大小修飾符可覆寫它。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [alert.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/alert/alert.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [alert.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/alert/alert.css)"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component's CSS renders and works on its own; pair it with `@pantoken/interactions` to add the interactive behavior. Its `-timeout` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "此元件的 CSS 可獨立呈現與運作；與 `@pantoken/interactions` 搭配可加入互動行為。其 `-timeout` 修飾符由該行為驅動。參見下方的 [modifier table](#modifiers)。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For an important message, add `role=\"alert\"` or an `aria-live` region so assistive tech announces it; the dismiss control is a labelled close button (the `.instui-close-button` in the example carries `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "對於重要訊息，新增 `role=\"alert\"` 或一個 `aria-live` 區域以便輔助技術能夠宣告；關閉控制是一個已標示的關閉按鈕（範例中的 `.instui-close-button` 帶有 `aria-label=\"Close\"`）。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "\n  An alert with the default "
msgstr "\n  一個具有預設的警示 "

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " color, and a custom icon.\n"
msgstr " 顏色，以及自訂圖示.\n"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "\n  Congratulations! You're using the \"success\" color.\n  "
msgstr "\n  恭喜！你正在使用「success」色彩.\n  "

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The alert's message content; may include a dismiss button."
msgstr "警示的訊息內容；可包含一個關閉按鈕。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An error message."
msgstr "錯誤訊息。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Informational (default)."
msgstr "資訊性（預設）。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A positive/confirmation message."
msgstr "正向／確認訊息。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A cautionary message."
msgstr "警示／注意訊息。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Swap the status glyph for a custom icon (e.g. `-icon-megaphone`), kept white on the variant's coloured bar."
msgstr "用自訂圖示替換狀態圖示（例如 `-icon-megaphone`），在變體的彩色色條上保持為白色。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
