msgstr "實心的變體彩色狀態色條，與圓角起始邊緣齊平。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The low-level status-glyph source; `-icon-<name>` sets it for you. Override for a custom icon (a url-encoded SVG)."
msgstr "低階的狀態圖示來源；`-icon-<name>` 會為你設定。可覆寫為自訂圖示（URL 編碼的 SVG）。"

#: css/alert.md
