msgstr "圖示後方的彩色狀態色條填充；每個 `-color-*` 變體會設定其自己的填充。"

#: css/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds before automatic dismissal; `0` disables it. Requires the alert interaction bundle."
msgstr "自動關閉前的毫秒數；`0` 可停用。需要 alert 互動套件。"

