#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-banner` · `alpha` — A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "`.instui-banner` · `alpha` — 可關閉、帶圖示的訊息面板，用於頁面層級或內嵌情境的公告。"

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Size** controls padding and gap: `relaxed` (default) is roomier; `compact` tightens both.\n  **Color** sets the fill: bare (no modifier) is unfilled — border and icon only; `-color-violet`\n  and `-color-sea` add a tinted background plus a matching icon swatch."
msgstr "**Size** 控制內距與間距：`relaxed`（預設）較寬鬆；`compact` 則會收緊兩者。\n  **Color** 設定填充：bare（無修飾詞）為無底色 — 僅有邊框與圖示；`-color-violet` 和 `-color-sea` 則會加入有色背景並匹配圖示色塊。"

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `role=\"status\"` (or `role=\"alert\"` for urgent messages) so assistive tech announces the\n  banner; mark a decorative icon `aria-hidden=\"true\"` and give the close button an `aria-label`."
msgstr "加入 `role=\"status\"`（或針對緊急訊息使用 `role=\"alert\"`），以便輔助技術宣告該橫幅；將裝飾性圖示標記為 `aria-hidden=\"true\"`，並為關閉按鈕提供 `aria-label`。"

