msgstr "小型欄間距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align child fields to a shared grid."
msgstr "將子欄位對齊到共用格線。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
