msgstr "將子欄位內聯排列成一列。"

#: css/form-field-group.md css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the group as required."
msgstr "將此群組標記為必填。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large row gap."
msgstr "大型列間距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium row gap."
msgstr "中型列間距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No row gap."
msgstr "無列間距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small row gap."
msgstr "小型列間距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the fields."
msgstr "欄位靠底部對齊。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Middle-align the fields."
msgstr "欄位置中對齊。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the fields."
msgstr "欄位靠頂部對齊。"

#: css/form-field-group.md css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the legend text when the group is required."
msgstr "當群組為必填時，於標題文字後呈現裝飾用的必填星號。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `-layout-aligned` mode uses CSS subgrid behind an `@supports` guard; where subgrid is unsupported, the fields fall back to their own stacked layout."
msgstr "- `-layout-aligned` 模式在 `@supports` 保護下使用 CSS subgrid；當 subgrid 不被支援時，欄位會退回各自的堆疊佈局。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — The single field this group repeats.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Groups radio inputs under a legend."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — 此群組重複的單一欄位。\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — 在標題下群組單選輸入。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-messages` — 欄位說明與驗證訊息 — 提示、錯誤、成功，以及僅供螢幕閱讀器使用 — 錯誤與成功時帶有一個圖示。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between stacked messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在堆疊訊息之間設定其自身的 `gap`；串接 `-gap-*` 間距工具修飾子會覆蓋該內建值。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `-type-screenreader-only` message is visually hidden but stays in the accessibility tree, so it's still announced; pair error and success messages with the field via aria-describedby so assistive tech reads them with the control."
msgstr "一則 `-type-screenreader-only` 訊息在視覺上被隱藏，但仍保留於無障礙樹中，因此仍會被播報；將錯誤與成功訊息透過 aria-describedby 與欄位配對，讓輔助技術在讀取該控制項時一併讀出。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "We'll never share it."
msgstr "我們絕不會分享它。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enter a valid email address."
msgstr "請輸入有效的電子郵件地址。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An individual message; its `-type-*` picks the hint, error, success, or screen-reader-only variant."
msgstr "單一訊息；其 `-type-*` 可選擇提示、錯誤、成功或僅供螢幕閱讀器使用的變體。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the leading status glyph on error and success messages: an alert circle for errors and a check circle for success."
msgstr "在錯誤與成功訊息上呈現領前狀態圖示：錯誤顯示警示圓圈，成功顯示勾選圓圈。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Wraps a label, controls, and these messages."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — 包裹標籤、控制項與這些訊息。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field` — 表單欄位的包裝：標籤、其控制項，以及內聯、必填或唯讀的配置。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` (after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "錯誤訊息會隱藏，直到欄位的控制項為 `:user-invalid`（使用者互動後）或你加入 `-invalid` 類別。使用 `-layout-inline` 可將標籤置於控制項旁，使用 `-layout-stacked` 可將標籤置於上方。此元件也會在標籤、控制項與訊息之間設定自己的 `gap`；串接 `-gap-*` 間距工具修飾器會覆寫該內建值。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `<label>` element wraps the control, so the label text names it natively; the required asterisk is decorative and should be hidden from assistive tech (aria-hidden), and the error message surfaces once the control is `:user-invalid` or you add the `-invalid` class."
msgstr "`<label>` 元素包裹控制項，因此標籤文字會原生為其命名；必填星號僅為裝飾，應對輔助技術隱藏（aria-hidden），而錯誤訊息會在控制項為 `:user-invalid` 或你加入 `-invalid` 類別時顯示。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "電子郵件地址"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout (shorthand for `-layout-inline`)."
msgstr "內聯配置（為 `-layout-inline` 的簡寫）。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the label text."
msgstr "讓標籤文字靠結尾對齊。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the label text."
msgstr "讓標籤文字靠起始對齊。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout: label beside the controls."
msgstr "內聯配置：標籤置於控制項旁。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stacked layout: label above the controls."
msgstr "堆疊配置：標籤置於控制項上方。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "讓標籤與控制項底部對齊。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "讓標籤與控制項頂部對齊。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control area beside or below the label."
msgstr "標籤旁或下方的控制項區域。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The field label."
msgstr "欄位標籤。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the label text when the field is required."
msgstr "在欄位為必填時，於標籤文字後呈現裝飾用的必填星號。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Renders the field's hint, error, and success messages.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Groups related fields under a shared legend."
msgstr "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — 呈現欄位的提示、錯誤與成功訊息。\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — 將相關欄位以共用的 legend 群組。"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--gap-md` — Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "`.--gap-md` — 在間距刻度上的 Flex/grid `gap` 工具，短寫（`--gap-sm`）或長寫（`--gap-small`）。可單獨使用或串接到任何元件（`.instui-view.--gap-sm`）— 已從組件專用 token 設定自己 `gap` 的元件可能會被覆寫。"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"

#: css/gap.md css/layout.md
