msgstr "二"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the medium spacing token as the gap."
msgstr "將中等間距的 token 套用為間隙。"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Gap utilities across short and long spacing-step spellings."
msgstr "支援短寫與長寫間距步階拼寫的間隙工具。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-heading` — Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "`.instui-heading` — 標題字體，從 `-level-h1` 到 `-level-h6`。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets override a `-level-*`'s font-size and font-weight, so combine only one of each family per element."
msgstr "`-variant-*` 預設會覆蓋 `-level-*` 的字體大小與字重，因此每個元素應僅結合來自同一字體家族的其中一種。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These classes set the visual level only, so render a real `<h1>`–`<h6>` (or use `role=\"heading\"` with `aria-level`) to convey the heading level."
msgstr "這些類別僅設定視覺層級，應使用真實的 `<h1>`–`<h6>`（或搭配 `role=\"heading\"` 與 `aria-level`）來表達標題層級。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Heading h1"
msgstr "標題 h1"

#: css/heading.md
