#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "`.instui-mask` — 一種流程內覆層，填滿其已定位的父容器並將內容置中 — 例如卡片上的載入指示器。對於模態視窗（modal），建議使用原生的 `<dialog>`（其 `::backdrop` 即為遮罩）。這些 modifier 每一個也都可全域使用（獨立或串接到其他元件）— 參見 `mask` 全域工具。"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"

#: css/mask.md css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."
msgstr "使用 backdrop-filter 模糊遮罩後方的內容。"

#: css/mask.md css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."
msgstr "固定於視窗（viewport），以高 z-index 覆蓋其上。"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "`.--mask-overlay` — 全域的成對複製 `mask` 元件的 overlay 修飾子 — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — 可直接使用或串接於任意元件上，無需包裹在 `.instui-mask` 元素中。"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."
msgstr "完整的遮罩覆蓋（位置、置中、背景）。"

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.group` — A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "`.group` — 帶標籤的群組標題 (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "`.item` — 選單項目（InstUI `Menu.Item`）；加入 -disabled、-highlighted 或 -active/[aria-checked]。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a checked item with `aria-checked=\"true\"` (same styling as `-active`)."
msgstr "以 `aria-checked=\"true\"` 標示已勾選的項目（與 `-active` 相同的樣式）。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Active/checked highlight; same styling as `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "啟動/勾選的強調樣式；與 `[aria-checked=\"true\"]` 相同的樣式。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Muted, non-interactive."
msgstr "弱化，非互動。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlighted background/text (keyboard focus or hover)."
msgstr "被突顯的背景/文字（鍵盤焦點或滑鼠懸停）。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary info text within the item."
msgstr "項目內的次要資訊文字。"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-menu` — A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "`.instui-menu` — 一個包含項目、群組與分隔符的下拉表面。"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compose entries as `.item` (see the `menu.item` member), label a section with `.group` (see `menu.group`), and divide sections with `.separator` (see `menu.separator`)."
msgstr "以 `.item` 組成條目（參見 `menu.item` 成員）、用 `.group` 標記區段（參見 `menu.group`），並使用 `.separator` 將區段分隔（參見 `menu.separator`）。"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"

