msgstr "大型度量數字。"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `&lt;img&gt;` goes full-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "父項 `modal` 的 `-overflow-fit`、`-density-compact` 和 `-color-inverse` 修飾子會重新設定此成員的樣式 — 有關那些修飾子的說明，請參見 `modal` 本身的文件。"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — 動作列（InstUI `Modal.Footer`）。"

#: css/modal.footer.md css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "父層的 `modal` 的 `-density-compact` 和 `-color-inverse` 修飾符會重新樣式化此成員 — 有關這些修飾符請參閱 `modal` 的文件。"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
