msgstr "`.header` — 標題列 (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — 對話視窗表面（支援原生 <dialog>）；包含 header/body/footer 部分。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "請參閱 `modal.header`、`modal.body` 與 `modal.footer` 成員以了解各個部分。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "使用 `showModal()` 開啟原生 `<dialog>` 以取得模態語意與 Esc 關閉行為，並以指向 `.header` 的 `aria-labelledby` 為其命名。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " — a narrow modal."
msgstr " — 一個窄的模態視窗。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "使模態背後的背景產生模糊效果。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "深色主題的外觀（與媒體本文配對）。@affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — 重新著色各部分以呈現深色外觀。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "收窄各部分的內邊距。@affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — 收緊各部分的填充。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "限制於視窗並捲動主體。@affects modal.body — 當模態受視窗限制時捲動主體內容。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "依內容調整大小。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "邊到邊顯示。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "寬版模態。為 `-size-lg` 的長名別名。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "寬版模態。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "窄版模態。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "窄版模態。為 `-size-sm` 的長名別名。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "將對話後方的頁面變暗作為遮罩，並在 `-blur` 下方添加毛玻璃效果。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- 為原生 <dialog> 及其 `::backdrop` 套用樣式；頂層呈現與背景樣式需瀏覽器支援 dialog 元素。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — tray 是相同的可關閉覆蓋元件模式，但錨定於畫面邊緣。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — 一個具有 +/- 微調欄位的數字輸入外觀。"

#: css/number-input.md
