#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress-circle` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties."
msgstr "`.instui-progress-circle` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — 由 `--value` 與 `--value-max` 自訂屬性驅動的圓形進度環。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ring is a `conic-gradient` donut painted on `::before` and clipped with a radial-gradient mask; `--value` divided by `--value-max` drives the arc. Add `-should-animate` and load the interactions entry point to animate it from zero on mount. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), spinning the ring at a fixed arc and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "此環是一個繪製在 `::before` 上並以放射狀漸層遮罩裁切的 `conic-gradient` 甜甜圈；由 `--value` 除以 `--value-max` 決定弧度。加入 `-should-animate` 並載入互動入口以在掛載時從零開始動畫。InstUI 無不確定（indeterminate）狀態；`:indeterminate` 是 pantoken 的最佳猜測（原生 `<progress>` 沒有 `value` 屬性），以固定弧度旋轉環並隱藏 `.value`，因為沒有可顯示的實際數值。`<meter>` 沒有不確定狀態，因此不受影響。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress-circle.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress-circle/progress-circle.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress-circle.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress-circle/progress-circle.css)"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component's CSS renders and works on its own; pair it with `@pantoken/interactions` to add the interactive behavior. Its `-should-animate` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "此元件的 CSS 可獨立渲染與運作；搭配 `@pantoken/interactions` 可加入互動行為。其 `-should-animate` 修飾符由該行為驅動。參見 [下面的修飾符表](#modifiers)。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Use native `<progress>` for a zero-based task completion range and `<meter>` when the minimum is non-zero. Give either element an accessible name by nesting it in `<label>` or associating a separate `<label>` through matching `for` and `id` values."
msgstr "在最小值為零時使用原生 `<progress>` 作為以零為基準的任務完成範圍；當最小值非零時使用 `<meter>`。可將任一元素置於 `<label>` 內或透過相符的 `for` 與 `id` 值關聯獨立的 `<label>`，以提供可及的名稱。"

