msgstr "資訊量表顏色。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) meter colour."
msgstr "深色背景（主反色）量表顏色。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success meter colour."
msgstr "成功量表顏色。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning meter colour."
msgstr "警示量表顏色。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default)."
msgstr "中等（預設）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "中等（預設）。`-size-md` 的長形式別名。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text centred in the ring's hole."
msgstr "置於環空心中央的數值文字。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; spins `::before` at a fixed arc and hides `.value`."
msgstr "自訂，非 InstUI 的一部分。僅適用於缺少 `value` 屬性的原生 `<progress>`；以固定弧度旋轉 `::before` 並隱藏 `.value`。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the ring itself: a conic-gradient donut clipped with a radial mask, whose arc tracks the `--value` custom property."
msgstr "繪製環本體：一個以放射錐形漸層（conic-gradient）製成的甜甜圈，並以放射狀遮罩裁切，其弧度追蹤 `--value` 自訂屬性。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds to wait before starting the mount animation (default `0`)."
msgstr "在開始掛載動畫前要等待的毫秒數（預設 `0`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "最大進度值（預設 `100`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The minimum meter value (default `0`)."
msgstr "最小量表值（預設 `0`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled arc (meter) colour; the -color-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "填充弧（量表）顏色；由 -color-* 修飾符設定。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ring's stroke width; the -size-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "環的筆觸寬度；由 -size-* 修飾符設定。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unfilled track colour."
msgstr "未填充軌道的顏色。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value; registered with @property so it can transition."
msgstr "目前的進度值；已以 @property 註冊以便可過渡動畫。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias {@link --max} The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "@alias {@link --max} 最大進度值（預設 `100`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias Alias for `--value`."
msgstr "@alias `--value` 的別名。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Registers the numeric progress properties with `@property` and paints with CSS `mask` and `conic-gradient`; where custom-property transitions are unsupported the ring still renders but won't animate."
msgstr "- 將數值進度屬性註冊到 `@property` 並使用 CSS 的 `mask` 與 `conic-gradient` 進行繪製；在不支援自訂屬性過渡的環境中，環仍會渲染但不會動畫化。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — The linear bar form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — 相同確定（determinate）進度的線性條形式。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — 一個具有有色量表、尺寸與可選值標籤的確定型進度條。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.value` is a sibling of `.bar`, both children of the root — mirroring how progress-circle nests its own `.value` part. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), animating `.bar` as a sliding segment and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "`.value` 與 `.bar` 為同級（皆為根節點的子項）——類似 progress-circle 如何在其內部嵌套自己的 `.value` 部分。InstUI 沒有不確定狀態；`:indeterminate` 是 pantoken 的推測實作（原生 `<progress>` 缺少 `value` 屬性），會將 `.bar` 動畫化為滑動區段並隱藏 `.value`，因為沒有可顯示的有意義數值。`<meter>` 沒有不確定狀態，因此不受影響。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Storage used"
msgstr "已使用的儲存空間"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders `.value` inside the track, aligned to its start, instead of beside it; style it for legibility over the meter colour."
msgstr "將 `.value` 呈現在軌道內並對齊於起始端，而非置於旁側；請為其設計樣式以確保在量表顏色上可讀性。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled meter bar."
msgstr "已填充的量表條。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text beside the bar."
msgstr "位於欄旁的數值文字。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; animates `.bar` as a sliding segment and hides `.value`."
msgstr "自訂，非 InstUI 所有。僅適用於缺少 `value` 屬性的原生 `<progress>`；會將 `.bar` 動畫化為滑動區段並隱藏 `.value`。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the track's bottom rule as its own layer over the meter, so the full border and the bottom border stay independent across themes."
msgstr "將軌道的底部邊線繪製為覆蓋在量表之上的獨立圖層，讓整體邊框與底部邊框在各主題間保持獨立。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value."
msgstr "目前的進度值。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Scopes the meter part rules with the `@scope` at-rule; browsers without `@scope` support ignore those scoped rules."
msgstr "- 使用 `@scope` at-rule 對量表部分的規則加上作用域；不支援 `@scope` 的瀏覽器會忽略那些有作用域的規則。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — The circular form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — 同一確定型進度的圓形形式。"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`:where(body)` — Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "`:where(body)` — 原始 HTML 的排版預設 — 標題、段落、清單、連結與程式碼 — 在每處匯入時會自動套用（預設為 `:where(body)`）；若要改為針對不同的內容根目錄，請傳入 `options.scope`（例如 `.vp-doc`）。"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"

