#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio-input-group` — A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`.instui-radio-input-group` — 單選的 radio `<fieldset>`，可為一般樣式或作為連接的分段切換。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between radios; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在 radios 間設定其自身的 `gap`；串接 `-gap-*` 間距工具修飾符會覆蓋該內建值。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>` that names the group; the child radios share one `name`, so only one can be selected at a time."
msgstr "呈現一個原生的 `<fieldset>`，並使用命名群組的 `<legend>`；子 radio 共用一個 `name`，因此一次只能選取一個。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "T-shirt size"
msgstr "T恤尺寸"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Small"
msgstr " 小號"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Medium"
msgstr " 中號"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Large"
msgstr " 大號"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out in columns."
msgstr "將 radios 以欄列方式排列。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out inline."
msgstr "將 radios 行內排列。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the child toggles out as a segmented control (only the selected segment fills)."
msgstr "將子切換排列為分段控制（僅被選取的區段會填滿）。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The individual control this group collects.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — The general wrapper for grouping and laying out fields."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — 此群組收集的單一控制項。\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — 用於群組與配置欄位的一般包裹容器。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio` — A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "`.instui-radio` — 原生的單選按鈕及其標籤。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在控制項與其標籤之間設置自身的 `gap`；串接 `-gap-*` 間距工具修飾符會覆寫該內建值。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"radio\">` drives `:checked` and `:disabled`; `-readonly` is styling only, since radios have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "原生的 `<input type=\"radio\">` 會驅動 `:checked` 與 `:disabled`；`-readonly` 僅用於樣式，因為單選按鈕沒有原生的唯讀屬性。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Option A"
msgstr " 選項 A"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "危險情境顏色（切換變體）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Off/neutral context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "關閉/中性情境顏色（切換變體）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "成功情境顏色（切換變體）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "警告情境顏色（切換變體）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a segmented toggle button."
msgstr "呈現為分段式切換按鈕。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled inner dot shown when checked; on `-variant-toggle` it is the focus ring drawn just outside the pill."
msgstr "勾選時顯示的填滿內點；在 `-variant-toggle` 上，它是繪製在膠囊外側的聚焦圓環。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle's selected fill colour; the -context-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "切換選取時的填充顏色；由 -context-* 修飾符設定。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — The multi-select counterpart to a single-select radio.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Collects radios into one single-select fieldset."
msgstr "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — 多選的對應元件，對應單選按鈕。\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — 將多個單選按鈕收集為一個單選的 fieldset。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-range-input` — A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "`.instui-range-input` — 一個有樣式的範圍滑桿，帶有反向值氣泡。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each vendor thumb/track pseudo-element needs its own separate rule — grouping them in one selector list would invalidate the whole rule in browsers that don't recognize the other vendor's pseudo."
msgstr "每個廠商的 thumb/track 偽元素需要各自的獨立規則 — 將它們放在同一個選擇器列表中，會在不識別其他廠商偽元素的瀏覽器中使整個規則失效。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control is a native `<input type=\"range\">`; give it an accessible name with `aria-label` or an associated `<label>`."
msgstr "此控制項是原生的 `<input type=\"range\">`；請以 `aria-label` 或關聯的 `<label>` 為其提供無障礙名稱。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the value bubble's caret, a small triangle pointing back toward the track."
msgstr "繪製數值氣泡的尖角（caret），一個指向軌道的小三角形。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The typed numeric-entry counterpart."
msgstr "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — 對應的數字輸入元件。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-rating` — A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "`.instui-rating` — 一個具有填滿與空心字形的星級評分，並可選帶有數字標籤。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between star glyphs; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在星形字元之間設定其自己的 `gap`；串接 `-gap-*` 間距工具類修飾符會覆寫該內建值。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give it role=\"img\" and an aria-label stating the rating, since the stars are icon glyphs."
msgstr "由於星號為圖示字元，請為其設定 role=\"img\" 並提供說明評分的 aria-label。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render star glyphs with icon classes (for example, `-icon-star-solid`)."
msgstr "使用圖示類別來呈現星形字元（例如，`-icon-star-solid`）。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The numeric label, e.g. \"3/5\"."
msgstr "數字標籤，例如 \"3/5\"."

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — 在主題化斷點尺度內，依視窗寬度或容器寬度顯示/隱藏的類別。"

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` hide by viewport width; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` are the inverse (hidden by default, shown only inside the range via `display: revert`); the `-cq-` variants react to a `.instui-container` ancestor's width instead, not the viewport's. Scale tiers `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (sourced from the IR's tray-width component tokens) are each aliased to a long-form spelling (`x-small`–`x-large`) and a device name (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — both deprecated in favor of the short name — plus the unscaled, themed `content`/`content-full-width` tiers (the main content area's max-width)."
msgstr "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` 依視窗寬度隱藏；`.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` 則相反（預設隱藏，僅在範圍內透過 `display: revert` 顯示）；`-cq-` 變體改為對祖先的 `.instui-container` 寬度作出反應，而非視窗。刻度等級 `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl`（來源於 IR 的 tray-width 元件 token）各別有一個長形式別名（`x-small`–`x-large`）和一個裝置名稱（`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`）— 兩者皆已不建議使用，改以短名稱為主 — 以及未縮放的主題化 `content`/`content-full-width` 等級（主要內容區的最大寬度）。"

