#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.item` — 一個導覽項目（InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`）；`-selected` 標示目前啟用的項目。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `side-nav-bar`'s `-minimized` modifier hides this member's `.label` — see `side-nav-bar`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "父層 `side-nav-bar` 的 `-minimized` 修飾器會隱藏此成員的 `.label` — 有關該修飾器請參見 `side-nav-bar` 的文件。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active nav item."
msgstr "目前啟用的導覽項目。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The item's text label; hidden when the rail is minimized."
msgstr "項目的文字標籤；當側欄縮小時會隱藏。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — 由圖示置於標籤上方的垂直導覽欄，並提供縮小的僅顯示圖示模式。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between nav items and its own `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. See the `side-nav-bar.item` member for the individual nav entries."
msgstr "在導覽項目之間以及自身的 `padding` 之間設定其自己的 `gap`；串接 `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` 的間距實用修飾子會覆寫那些內建值。個別導覽項目請參見 `side-nav-bar.item` 成員。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
