#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--p-md` — Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "`.--p-md` — 邊距與內距工具 — 在間距刻度上使用 `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` 與 `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>`（側邊：`t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y`，或不設，支援短寫或完整長寫拼法 — 例如 `--mb-sm` 與 `--margin-bottom-small` 為相同規則；邊距也接受 `auto`）。可直接使用或串接於任何元件（例如 `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`）。"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"

