msgstr "`.instui-spinner` — 一個動畫載入圈；請為它設置 role=\"status\" 與 aria-label。"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-color-inverse` only repaints the animated top border segment, not the whole track, so it still reads correctly on a dark card without needing a separate track color."
msgstr "`-color-inverse` 只會重繪頂部有動畫的邊框段，而非整個軌道，因此在深色卡片上仍能正確顯示，不需要額外的軌道顏色。"

#: css/spinner.md
