#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-details` — A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-details` — 一個帶有旋轉箭頭的樣式化原生 `<details>` 揭示元件。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the native `<details>` element, so the browser drives open and close plus keyboard support; the CSS only hides the default marker and supplies the rotating chevron."
msgstr "建立在原生 `<details>` 元素之上，因此由瀏覽器處理展開/收合與鍵盤支援；CSS 只隱藏預設標記並提供旋轉箭頭。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What ships in this package?"
msgstr "此套件包含什麼？"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "\n  Class-based component styles, built from the Instructure tokens, plus a prose layer.\n"
msgstr "\n  基於 Instructure 代幣構建的類別式元件樣式，外加一層散文（prose）層。\n"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the chevron after the summary."
msgstr "將箭頭置於 summary 之後。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filled (surface) variant."
msgstr "實心（表面）變體。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the disclosure is open."
msgstr "繪製 summary 的揭示箭頭，一個帶遮罩的字形，當揭示展開時會旋轉向下。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — The bordered, grouped form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — 帶有邊框且群組化的相同揭示形式。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-group` — A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-group` — 基於 `<details>` 的有邊框揭露組件：包含一列帶有 chevron 的摘要列與可摺疊內容。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the same native `<details>` foundation as toggle-details; put the `<summary>` first so it becomes the clickable header row and the rest is the collapsible content."
msgstr "建立於與 toggle-details 相同的原生 `<details>` 基座；將 `<summary>` 放在前面，使其成為可點擊的標頭列，其餘為可摺疊內容。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "進階設定"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These options are revealed when the group is expanded. The header row carries a chevron that rotates on open, and the content sits below a divider."
msgstr "當群組展開時會顯示這些選項。標頭列帶有在開啟時會旋轉的 chevron（小箭頭），內容位於分隔線下方。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary row's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the group is open."
msgstr "繪製摘要列的揭露 chevron，這是一個遮罩字形，群組開啟時會旋轉並指向下方。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — The single, unbordered form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — 同一揭露的單一無邊框形式。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tooltip` — A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "`.instui-tooltip` — 一個 CSS 的懸停與聚焦提示氣泡，可定位於任一側。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Toggling is pure CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), so the bubble only reaches keyboard users through a focusable trigger; unlike `popover`, it isn't dismissible or click-triggered."
msgstr "切換純屬 CSS（`:hover`/`:focus-within`），因此該氣泡只能透過可聚焦的觸發器讓鍵盤使用者使用；與 `popover` 不同，無法被取消且非點擊觸發。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Point the trigger at the bubble with aria-describedby and give the bubble role=\"tooltip\"."
msgstr "使用 aria-describedby 將觸發器指向氣泡，並為氣泡設定 role=\"tooltip\"。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Default placement is top"
msgstr "預設位置為上方"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a trigger glyph icon next to the tooltip bubble."
msgstr "在提示氣泡旁呈現一個觸發用字形圖示。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The bubble; `-placement-*` sets its side."
msgstr "該氣泡；其側向由 `-placement-*` 設定。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The larger, click-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — 較大的、以點擊觸發的錨定面板。\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — 一個相關的、帶指向器的錨定面板。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — 適用於 `Transition` 元件的動畫狀態類別 — `.instui-transition` 與狀態類別（`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited` 等）— 可單獨使用或串接到任何元件上。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animated content"
msgstr "動畫內容"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."
msgstr "由執行時切換的過渡類型/狀態類別（`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`）。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state."
msgstr "動畫持續時間（預設 `300ms`）；可覆寫以加速或減慢每個過渡狀態。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "動畫時序函數（預設 `ease-in-out`）。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tray` — An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "`.instui-tray` — 一個固定於邊緣、可從任一側滑入的面板；原生的 `[popover]` 或 `<dialog>`。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start/end placements resolve against `inset-inline` (logical, direction-aware); the slide-in transform mirrors automatically under an ancestor `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, so no extra markup is needed for right-to-left layouts."
msgstr "起始/結束的放置相對於 `inset-inline` 解算（邏輯化、具方向感）；當位於祖先 `[dir=\"rtl\"]` 之下時，滑入轉換會自動鏡像，因此右到左佈局不需要額外標記。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The tray is a dialog or popover surface, so name it with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and its close control carries an `aria-label` (the `.instui-close-button` in the example uses `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "托盤是一個對話框或彈出層表面，因此以 `aria-label` 或 `aria-labelledby` 命名，其關閉控制帶有 `aria-label`（範例中的 `.instui-close-button` 使用了 `aria-label=\"Close\"`）。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "篩選"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A tray slides in from the start edge and fills the viewport height."
msgstr "一個抽屜從起始邊滑入並填滿視窗高度。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "toggle tray"
msgstr "切換抽屜"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the bottom edge."
msgstr "釘選至底邊。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the end (inline-end) edge."
msgstr "釘選至結束（inline-end）邊緣。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Pin to the start (inline-start) edge."
msgstr "(預設) 釘選至起始（inline-start）邊緣。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the top edge."
msgstr "釘選至頂部邊緣。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Opens with the native `[popover]` API and `@starting-style`; the slide-in sits behind an `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` guard, so browsers without it still open the tray, just without the slide."
msgstr "- 使用原生 `[popover]` API 和 `@starting-style` 開啟；滑入效果置於 `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` 防護之後，因此不支援該防護的瀏覽器仍會開啟托盤，但不會有滑入效果。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — The same dismissible overlay pattern, centred instead of edge-pinned.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer surface this builds on."
msgstr "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — 相同的可關閉覆蓋模式，改為置中而非固定於邊緣。\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — 此元件所構築的通用頂層表面。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tree-browser` — A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "`.instui-tree-browser` — 一個由巢狀集合與葉節點項目組成的揭示樹，具有可旋轉的箭頭圖示。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each collection is a native `<details>`; nesting them inside one another builds the tree, and the browser handles opening and closing every branch."
msgstr "每個集合都是原生的 `<details>`；將它們互相巢狀即可構成樹，瀏覽器會處理每個分支的展開與收合。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the root with role=\"tree\" and each nested list with role=\"group\"."
msgstr "將根標記為 role=\"tree\"，並將每個巢狀清單標記為 role=\"group\"。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Course files"
msgstr " 課程檔案"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Syllabus.pdf"
msgstr " 課程大綱.pdf"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Week 1"
msgstr " 第1週"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Reading.pdf"
msgstr " 閱讀資料.pdf"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Slides.pptx"
msgstr " 投影片.pptx"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid " Rubric.docx"
msgstr " 評分規準.docx"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render folder/file glyph icons in summaries and leaf items."
msgstr "在摘要與葉節點項目中呈現資料夾/檔案的圖示。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leaf entry in the tree."
msgstr "樹中的一個葉項目。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open."
msgstr "繪製每個集合的揭示 chevron 箭頭，這是一個遮罩圖示，當分支展開時會旋轉指向下方。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries."
msgstr "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — 兩者皆呈現巢狀且可選取的條目。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "`.--truncate` — 使用行數限制的省略號截斷，由 `--lines` 控制 — 可獨立使用或鏈接至任何元件（`.instui-button.--truncate`）。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base class uses `display: -webkit-box` and reads the `--lines` custom property to clamp text to a fixed number of lines before it ends in an ellipsis."
msgstr "基底類使用 `display: -webkit-box`，並讀取 `--lines` 自訂屬性以在結尾顯示省略號前將文字限制為固定行數。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component ships no CSS of its own — its markup and behavior come entirely from `@pantoken/interactions`. Its `--max-lines-auto` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
