msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — 兩欄配置，含左右兩個內容區域。"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "✅ 何時使用兩欄："

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You have two content areas of roughly equal importance\n- Comparing or contrasting two sets of content side-by-side\n- Building a responsive layout that stacks on mobile\n🚫 Don't use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "- 你有兩個重要性大致相當的內容區域\n- 要並排比較或對照兩組內容\n- 建立在行動裝置上會堆疊的響應式佈局\n🚫 何時不使用兩欄："

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- One column dominates the page — use asymmetric layout instead\n- Content doesn't benefit from side-by-side presentation"
msgstr "- 一欄主導頁面 — 改用不對稱佈局\n- 內容不適合並排呈現"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure both columns are perceivable and usable on narrow viewports\n- Use semantic landmarks (e.g., `<section>`) to wrap column content\n- Maintain sufficient space and contrast between columns"
msgstr "- 確保在窄螢幕上兩欄皆可被辨識且可用\n- 使用語意區塊（例如 `<section>`）包裹欄位內容\n- 保持欄位間足夠的間距與對比"

