#: design/figma/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/figma` — convert the Instructure token IR into a Figma Variables payload."
msgstr "`@pantoken/figma` — 將 Instructure token IR 轉換為 Figma Variables 的有效載荷。"

#: design/figma/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It produces one variable collection with `light`/`dark` modes: colour tokens become `COLOR`\nvariables (RGBA 0–1), dimensions/numbers become `FLOAT`, everything else `STRING`. Icons are\nexcluded (they'd be Figma components, not variables). Feed [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) to a Figma\nplugin (the Variables plugin API) or the Variables REST API — the README has the plugin glue."
msgstr "它會產生一個變數集合，具有 `light`/`dark` 模式：色彩 tokens 會變成 `COLOR`\n變數（RGBA 0–1），尺寸/數值 會變成 `FLOAT`，其他則為 `STRING`。圖示被\n排除（它們應該是 Figma 元件，而不是變數）。將 [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) 提供給 Figma\n外掛（Variables plugin API）或 Variables REST API — README 有外掛接合說明。"

#: design/figma/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
