msgid "`@pantoken/dtcg` — the Instructure tokens as a W3C Design Tokens (DTCG) document."
msgstr "`@pantoken/dtcg` — 將 Instructure 的 tokens 作為 W3C Design Tokens (DTCG) 文件。"

#: formats/dtcg/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default export is the `rebrand` DTCG tree; every theme is available by name. Use\n[toDtcg](functions/toDtcg.md) to convert an arbitrary IR yourself."
msgstr "預設導出是 `rebrand` 的 DTCG 樹狀結構；每個主題皆可按名稱取得。使用\n[toDtcg](functions/toDtcg.md) 將任意 IR 自行轉換。"

#: formats/dtcg/src/type-aliases/DtcgNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A DTCG token leaf or group."
msgstr "DTCG 代幣的葉節點或群組。"

#: formats/dtcg/src/variables/dtcg.md
#, no-c-format
