msgid "The `rebrand` theme as a DTCG document (the default)."
msgstr "將 `rebrand` 主題作為 DTCG 文件（預設）。"

#: formats/dtcg/src/variables/themes.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every theme's DTCG document, keyed by [Theme](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/Theme.md)."
msgstr "每個主題的 DTCG 文件，鍵入為 [Theme](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/Theme.md)。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the icon font."
msgstr "建立圖示字型。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The [IconFontResult](../interfaces/IconFontResult.md)."
msgstr "該 [IconFontResult](../interfaces/IconFontResult.md)。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build the full font and write the artifacts**"
msgstr "**建構完整字型並寫入成果物**"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/buildIconFont.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**A custom font name and a subset of icons from another theme**"
msgstr "**自訂字型名稱及來自另一主題的部分圖示**"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Produce a filled glyph path for an icon SVG."
msgstr "為圖示 SVG 產生填滿的字形路徑。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#: packages/core/src/functions/toVectorDrawable.md
#: packages/core/src/functions/toXcodeImageset.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline SVG markup."
msgstr "內嵌 SVG 標記。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled path `d` (in viewBox coordinates) and the viewBox size."
msgstr "已填滿的路徑 `d`（以 viewBox 座標）以及 viewBox 大小。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/functions/svgToGlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Outline a stroke-based (Lucide) icon and a fill-based icon**"
msgstr "**為基於筆觸（Lucide）的圖示與基於填滿的圖示畫出輪廓**"

#: formats/icon-font/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/icon-font` — build an installable Instructure icon font (WOFF2 + TTF) with a matching\nstylesheet and codepoint map. Unlike the inline-SVG paths, a font installs on a device, so it\nworks in design apps and offline contexts where the web tooling isn't reachable."
msgstr "`@pantoken/icon-font` — 建置可安裝的 Instructure 圖示字型 (WOFF2 + TTF)，並提供相對應的樣式表與字元對應表。與內嵌 SVG 路徑不同，字型可以安裝在裝置上，所以它\n可在設計應用程式以及無法存取網路工具的離線情境中運作。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stroke-based glyphs (Lucide) are outlined to fills so they render as real font glyphs; fill-based\nglyphs (Instructure custom) pass through."
msgstr "以筆畫為基礎的字形 (Lucide) 會將描邊轉換為實心填充，以便將它們呈現為真正的字型字形；以填充為基礎的\n字形 (Instructure custom) 則直接通過。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildIconFont](../functions/buildIconFont.md)."
msgstr "用於 [buildIconFont](../functions/buildIconFont.md) 的選項。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names to include (default: the whole set)."
msgstr "要包含的圖示名稱（預設：整套）。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The font family name (default `\"PanTokens\"`)."
msgstr "字型家族名稱（預設 `\"PanTokens\"`）。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/BuildIconFontOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme to source glyphs from (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "要從其擷取字形的主題（預設 `\"rebrand\"`）。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/GlyphPath.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A filled glyph path plus the SVG viewBox size to wrap it in."
msgstr "一個已填色的字形路徑，以及用於包裹它的 SVG viewBox 大小。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The generated font artifacts."
msgstr "生成的字型產物。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The TrueType font bytes."
msgstr "TrueType 字型位元組。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The WOFF2 font bytes."
msgstr "WOFF2 字型位元組。"

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `@font-face` + `.instui-icon-<name>` stylesheet."
msgstr "The `@font-face` + `.instui-icon-&lt;name&gt;` stylesheet."

#: formats/icon-font/src/interfaces/IconFontResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon name → hex codepoint (e.g. `\"e001\"`)."
msgstr "圖示名稱 → 十六進位碼位（例如 `\"e001\"`）。"

#: formats/icons/src/functions/buildIconResolverChain.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the shared icon-resolver chain: plugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit\n`resolve`, then the built-in pantoken icon set. Used by `@pantoken/rehype` and\n`@pantoken/markdown-it` so the resolution order stays identical across renderers."
msgstr "建立共用的圖示解析器鏈：先是外掛 `rehype` 的解析器，然後是一個明確的\n`resolve`，接著是內建的 pantoken 圖示集。由 `@pantoken/rehype` 和\n`@pantoken/markdown-it` 使用，以確保在各個渲染器中的解析順序保持一致。"

#: formats/icons/src/functions/getIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Look up an icon by name."
msgstr "依名稱查找圖示。"

#: formats/icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/icons` — an ergonomic view over the IR's `<image>` tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/icons` — an ergonomic view over the IR's `&lt;image&gt;` tokens."

#: formats/icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This is not a second source; it filters the canonical IR from `@pantoken/tokens` to the icon\ntokens and decodes each data-URI back to inline SVG, exposing a shape close to the\n`SimpleIconTokenData` that markdown/rehype consumers already use."
msgstr "這不是第二個來源；它將規範的 IR 從 `@pantoken/tokens` 篩選為 icon\ntokens，並將每個 data-URI 解碼回內嵌 SVG，暴露出一種接近於\n`SimpleIconTokenData`（markdown/rehype 使用者已在使用）的形狀。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/IconResolverChainOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options shared by the icon-resolving renderers ([buildIconResolverChain](../functions/buildIconResolverChain.md))."
msgstr "圖示解析渲染器共用的選項（[buildIconResolverChain](../functions/buildIconResolverChain.md)）。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/IconResolverChainOptions.md
#: renderers/rehype/src/interfaces/RehypeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An explicit resolver, tried before the built-in pantoken icon set."
msgstr "一個明確的解析器，會在內建 pantoken 圖示集之前嘗試。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/IconResolverChainOptions.md
#: renderers/rehype/src/interfaces/RehypeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Plugins whose `rehype` hooks contribute resolvers (tried first)."
msgstr "插件，其 `rehype` 鉤子會提供解析器（優先嘗試）。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pantoken icon, derived from an `<image>` token."
msgstr "A pantoken icon, derived from an `&lt;image&gt;` token."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon name, without the `--instui-icon-` prefix (e.g. `arrow-left`)."
msgstr "圖示名稱，不含 `--instui-icon-` 前綴（例如 `arrow-left`）。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,…')` value, as stored in the IR."
msgstr "IR 中儲存的 `url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,…')` 值。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decoded inline SVG markup, stripped of `<script>` elements and event-handler attributes.\nOriginates from the vendored IR (pinned upstream). Safe for trusted injection contexts;\nconsumers should not treat this as safe for injection into attacker-controlled HTML."
msgstr "The decoded inline SVG markup, stripped of `&lt;script&gt;` elements and event-handler attributes.\nOriginates from the vendored IR (pinned upstream). Safe for trusted injection contexts;\nconsumers should not treat this as safe for injection into attacker-controlled HTML."

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The SVG `viewBox`, when known."
msgstr "若已知，SVG 的 `viewBox`。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether the icon flips horizontally in right-to-left contexts."
msgstr "圖示在從右到左（RTL）語境中是否會水平翻轉。"

#: formats/icons/src/interfaces/PantokenIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph origin."
msgstr "字形來源。"

#: formats/icons/src/variables/icons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every pantoken icon, sorted by name."
msgstr "按名稱排序的每個 pantoken 圖示。"

#: formats/icons/src/variables/iconsByName.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every pantoken icon, keyed by name."
msgstr "每個 pantoken 圖示，使用名稱作為鍵。"

#: formats/icons/src/variables/resolve.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An [IconResolver](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/IconResolver.md) backed by the pantoken icon set (for the plugin/rehype stages)."
msgstr "由 pantoken 圖示集支援的 [IconResolver](../../../../packages/core/src/type-aliases/IconResolver.md)（用於 plugin/re*hype 階段）。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/applySpacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply InstUI/CSS spacing attributes on `host` to inline style."
msgstr "將 InstUI/CSS 的間距屬性應用到 `host` 的內聯樣式。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/applySpacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Managed properties are cleared first, so removing an attribute removes its style."
msgstr "會先清除受管理的屬性，因此移除屬性會一併移除其樣式。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a close button to dismiss its target."
msgstr "將關閉按鈕接線，使其能關閉其目標。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target resolution (first match wins):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n3. walk up to the nearest `<dialog>`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"
msgstr "Target resolution (first match wins):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n3. walk up to the nearest `&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dismiss strategy:\n- `<dialog>` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"
msgstr "Dismiss strategy:\n- `&lt;dialog&gt;` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a contenteditable field for click-to-edit commit/revert behaviour.\nEnter commits, Escape reverts; blur also commits if the value changed.\nFires a bubbling `change` CustomEvent with `detail.value` on commit."
msgstr "為 click-to-edit 的提交/還原行為連接一個 contenteditable 欄位。\nEnter 鍵提交，Escape 鍵還原；若值改變，失焦也會提交。\n在提交時會觸發一個冒泡的 `change` CustomEvent，且包含 `detail.value`。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initInPlaceEdit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element (which IS contenteditable)\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"
msgstr "  CSS:  host = .instui-in-place-edit element（即為 contenteditable）\n  WC:   host = shadow .instui-in-place-edit span"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a CSS `<dialog class=\"instui-modal\">` or a web component's shadow\n`<dialog>` to the `open` attribute protocol and `--show/--close/--toggle`\ncommand routing. Both usages pass the same interface:"
msgstr "將 CSS `<dialog class=\"instui-modal\">` 或 web 元件的 shadow\n`<dialog>` 接到 `open` 屬性協定與 `--show/--close/--toggle`\n指令路由。兩種用法傳遞相同的介面："

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initModal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- CSS: `host === dialog` (the dialog itself carries the id and open attr)\n- WC: `host` = custom element, `dialog` = its shadow `<dialog>`"
msgstr "- CSS: `host === dialog` (the dialog itself carries the id and open attr)\n- WC: `host` = custom element, `dialog` = its shadow `&lt;dialog&gt;`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Release a ProgressCircle's mount-animation modifier after its configured delay."
msgstr "在其設定的延遲之後，移除 ProgressCircle 的 mount-animation 修飾符。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initProgressCircle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The delay is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless\n`--animation-delay` custom property. Missing, negative, and non-finite values become zero. Both the\ncanonical modifier and its deprecated typo alias are accepted and removed."
msgstr "延遲是明確的毫秒選項或目標計算出的無單位\n`--animation-delay` 自訂屬性。遺失、負值與非有限值皆視為零。正式的修飾符以及其已棄用的拼寫錯誤別名都會被接受並移除。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove a target after a timeout. Before removal, fires a cancelable, bubbling `dismiss` event.\nPreventing that event keeps the target mounted."
msgstr "在逾時後移除目標。移除之前會觸發可取消且會冒泡的 `dismiss` 事件。\n阻止該事件可使目標保持掛載。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initRemove.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The timeout is an explicit millisecond option or the target's computed, unitless `--timeout` CSS\ncustom property. Missing, non-finite, and non-positive values don't arm a timer. A fade uses the\n`@pantoken/components` `transition` utility's classes (`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`), then waits\nfor `transitionend` (with a fallback); `transition: \"none\"` removes immediately."
msgstr "逾時是以明確的毫秒選項或目標計算後的、無單位的 `--timeout` CSS\n自訂屬性來指定。遺漏、非有限或非正值不會啟動計時器。淡出會使用\n`@pantoken/components` `transition` 實用程式的類別（`.instui-transition` + `-fade-*`），然後等待\n`transitionend`（含回退）；`transition: \"none\"` 則會立即移除。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initResponsiveOverlay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire open/close commands plus width-based responsive overlay switching onto a host: any\ncollapsible side panel (e.g. a drawer's tray) can import this interaction rather than each\ncomponent reimplementing it."
msgstr "將開啟/關閉命令以及基於寬度的響應式覆蓋切換接線到宿主：任何可折疊的側邊面板（例如抽屜的托盤）都可以匯入此互動，而不需讓每個元件重新實作它。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire hover/focus show-hide with delay onto a tooltip wrapper and its tip\nbubble. Returns a cleanup function for use in web component disconnectedCallback."
msgstr "將帶有延遲的滑鼠懸停/聚焦 顯示／隱藏 行為連接到提示（tooltip）包裝器及其 tip\nbubble。回傳一個清理函數，供 web component 的 disconnectedCallback 使用。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "  CSS:  wrapper = .instui-tooltip element, tip = its .tip child\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip, tip = shadow .tip"
msgstr "  CSS:  wrapper = .instui-tooltip 元素，tip = 其 .tip 子元素\n  WC:   wrapper = shadow .instui-tooltip，tip = shadow .tip"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTruncateAuto.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep `--lines` in sync with available height for an auto-clamped truncate target."
msgstr "將 `--lines` 與可用高度保持同步，以配合自動夾持的截斷目標。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initTruncateAuto.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- CSS usage: pass the same element as `host` and `target`.\n- Web-component usage: pass custom-element host + shadow truncate target span."
msgstr "- CSS 用法：作為 `host` 與 `target` 傳入相同的元素。\n- Web 元件用法：傳入自訂元素的 host 與 shadow 中的截斷目標 span。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/makeOnCommand.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the `command`-event router: forward a target's `command` events to a handler, and where the\nInvoker Commands API is missing, delegate matching `commandfor` clicks across the target's tree."
msgstr "建立 `command`-事件路由器：將目標的 `command` 事件轉發給處理程式，並且當\nInvoker Commands API 缺失時，將相符的 `commandfor` 點擊委派到目標的樹狀結構中。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/resolveSpace.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve one spacing value: keyword alias to token, otherwise pass through unchanged."
msgstr "解析單一間距值：若為關鍵字別名則對應為 token，否則原樣傳遞。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/spacingValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve a 1-4 value InstUI spacing shorthand (`margin`/`padding`) to its CSS value."
msgstr "將 1-4 個值的 InstUI 間距簡寫 (`margin`/`padding`) 解析為其 CSS 值。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncInvoker.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mirror the host's invoker attributes onto its inner `<button>`'s IDL properties, resolving ids\nagainst the host's root so a shadow-DOM button can drive a light-DOM `[popover]`/command target."
msgstr "Mirror the host's invoker attributes onto its inner `&lt;button&gt;`'s IDL properties, resolving ids\nagainst the host's root so a shadow-DOM button can drive a light-DOM `[popover]`/command target."

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/syncTruncateAutoLines.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compute and apply a numeric `--lines` value from available height."
msgstr "計算並從可用高度套用數值 `--lines`。"

#: formats/interactions/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/interactions` - per-component interaction bundles for InstUI components."
msgstr "`@pantoken/interactions` - 每個元件的互動套件，用於 InstUI 元件。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `command`/`source` shape of an Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (not yet in DOM lib types)."
msgstr "`command`/`source` 形狀的 Invoker Commands `CommandEvent`（尚未在 DOM lib 類型中）。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`bubbles`** 唯讀屬性表示該事件是否會在 DOM 樹中向上冒泡。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`cancelBubble`** 屬性已被棄用。請改用 Event.stopPropagation()。在事件處理函式返回之前將其值設為 true 可防止事件的傳播。在較新的實現中，將其設為 false 不會產生作用。詳細請參閱瀏覽器相容性。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`cancelable`** 唯讀屬性表示該事件是否可被取消，進而可透過取消行為使該事件彷彿未曾發生。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Event 介面的唯讀 **`composed`** 屬性回傳一個布林值，表示該事件是否會穿越 shadow DOM 邊界並傳播到標準 DOM。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`currentTarget`** 唯讀屬性識別已附加事件處理程式的元素。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`defaultPrevented`** 唯讀屬性回傳一個布林值，表示對 Event.preventDefault() 的呼叫是否已取消該事件。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`eventPhase`** 唯讀屬性表示當前事件流程所處的階段。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`isTrusted`** 唯讀屬性為布林值：當事件由使用者代理（包括透過使用者操作與程式化方法如 HTMLElement.focus()）產生時為 true；當事件是透過 EventTarget.dispatchEvent() 派發時為 false。唯一例外是 click 事件，用戶代理會將 isTrusted 屬性初始化為 false。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Event 屬性 **`returnValue`** 表示此事件的預設動作是否已被阻止。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "已棄用的 **`Event.srcElement`** 為 Event.target 屬性的別名。請改用 Event.target。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Event 介面的唯讀 **`target`** 屬性參考事件被派發到的物件。當事件處理器在事件的冒泡或捕獲階段被呼叫時，此屬性與 Event.currentTarget 不同。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`timeStamp`** 唯讀屬性回傳事件建立時的時間（以毫秒為單位）。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`type`** 唯讀屬性回傳包含事件類型的字串。該值在事件建構時設定，通常用以指稱特定事件的名稱，例如 click、load 或 error。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`composedPath()`** method of the Event interface returns the event's path which is an array of the objects on which listeners will be invoked. This does not include nodes in shadow trees if the shadow root was created with its ShadowRoot.mode closed."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`composedPath()`** 方法回傳事件的路徑（path），該路徑為一個物件陣列，表示會呼叫監聽器的對象。如果 shadow root 是以 ShadowRoot.mode 設為 closed 建立，則不包含 shadow 樹中的節點。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`Event.initEvent()`** method is used to initialize the value of an event created using Document.createEvent()."
msgstr "**`Event.initEvent()`** 方法用於初始化透過 Document.createEvent() 建立之事件的值。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`preventDefault()`** method of the Event interface tells the user agent that the event is being explicitly handled, so its default action, such as page scrolling, link navigation, or pasting text, should not be taken."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`preventDefault()`** 方法告知使用者代理該事件已被明確處理，因此不應執行其預設動作，例如頁面滾動、連結導向或貼上文字等。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents other listeners of the same event from being called."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`stopImmediatePropagation()`** 方法可阻止相同事件的其他監聽器被呼叫。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`stopPropagation()`** method of the Event interface prevents further propagation of the current event in the capturing and bubbling phases. It does not, however, prevent any default behaviors from occurring; for instance, clicks on links are still processed. If you want to stop those behaviors, see the preventDefault() method. It also does not prevent propagation to other event-handlers of the current element. If you want to stop those, see stopImmediatePropagation()."
msgstr "Event 介面的 **`stopPropagation()`** 方法可阻止目前事件在捕獲與冒泡階段的進一步傳播。但它不會阻止任何預設行為發生；例如，對連結的點擊仍會被處理。若要阻止那些行為，請參閱 preventDefault() 方法。它也不會阻止當前元素的其他事件處理器被呼叫；若要阻止那些，請參閱 stopImmediatePropagation()。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/ProgressCircleHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initProgressCircle](../functions/initProgressCircle.md)."
msgstr "由 [initProgressCircle](../functions/initProgressCircle.md) 回傳的處理器。"

