msgstr "取消待處理的駁回與移除工作。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dismiss immediately, without waiting for the configured timeout."
msgstr "立即駁回，無需等待已設定的逾時。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for a timeout-based removal."
msgstr "基於逾時的移除選項。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds before dismissal. Defaults to the target's computed `--timeout`."
msgstr "關閉前的毫秒數。預設為目標計算出的 `--timeout`。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/RemoveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Exit treatment. Defaults to `\"fade\"`, matching InstUI Alert."
msgstr "離場處理。預設為 `\"fade\"`，與 InstUI Alert 相符。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initTooltip](../functions/initTooltip.md)."
msgstr "由 [initTooltip](../functions/initTooltip.md) 回傳的處理器。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipHandle.md
