msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove all event listeners and cancel any pending timer."
msgstr "移除所有事件監聽器並取消任何待執行的計時器。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Immediately cancel any pending show timer and remove `-show`."
msgstr "立即取消任何待執行的顯示計時器並移除 `-show`。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TooltipOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for show/hide timing."
msgstr "顯示/隱藏時機的選項。"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/TruncateAutoHandle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Handle returned by [initTruncateAuto](../functions/initTruncateAuto.md)."
msgstr "由 [initTruncateAuto](../functions/initTruncateAuto.md) 回傳的句柄。"

