msgid "Optional slot to watch for `slotchange` re-syncs in shadow DOM usage."
msgstr "在 Shadow DOM 使用時，用於監視 `slotchange` 重新同步的可選插槽。"

#: formats/interactions/src/type-aliases/CommandHandler.md
