#: index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken is a monorepo of small, single-purpose packages grouped into buckets. Install the one that\nfits your task, or install the unified `pantoken` package and import from its subpaths (for example\n`pantoken/css`, `pantoken/react`, `pantoken/tailwind`)."
msgstr "pantoken 是一個由小型、單一用途套件組成的 monorepo，按群組（bucket）排列。安裝適合你任務的套件，或安裝統一的 `pantoken` 套件並從其子路徑匯入（例如 `pantoken/css`, `pantoken/react`, `pantoken/tailwind`）。"

