msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emits native and other non-npm design-token source into a consumer repo — the targets that don't\nfit the npm-package model. Supported now: `swift` (with an SPM `Package.swift` manifest stub, so\nregistry publishing is later a config flip), `android`, `compose`, `flutter`, `wordpress`,\n`vanilla`, `drupal`, `swatches`, `rust`, `icon-font`, `pendo`, `jekyll`, `hugo`, and `mintlify`."
msgstr "將原生與其他非 npm 的設計代幣來源匯出到消費者的倉庫 — 這些目標不符合 npm 套件模型。\n當前支援：`swift`（帶有 SPM `Package.swift` 清單存根，因此之後在註冊表發佈只需切換設定）、`android`、`compose`、`flutter`、`wordpress`、`vanilla`、`drupal`、`swatches`、`rust`、`icon-font`、`pendo`、`jekyll`、`hugo`，以及 `mintlify`。"

