#: packages/core/src/functions/collectIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collect the unified InstUI icon layer. Custom glyphs take precedence over same-named Lucide\nglyphs. Output is sorted by name for deterministic results."
msgstr "收集統一的 InstUI 圖示圖層。自訂字形優先於同名的 Lucide\n字形。輸出依名稱排序以確保結果可重現。"

#: packages/core/src/functions/collectIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Collect every glyph plus the icon-colour special values**"
msgstr "**收集所有字形以及 icon-colour 特殊值**"

