msgstr "**僅限 Instructure 作者的字形**"

#: packages/core/src/functions/collectLeaves.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collect every leaf of a Tokens Studio tree. A leaf is a node with a `.value`:\na string value yields one leaf; a composite object value (typography) yields one leaf per\nsub-property named `<token>-<subProperty>`; array values (box-shadow lists) are skipped."
msgstr "Collect every leaf of a Tokens Studio tree. A leaf is a node with a `.value`:\na string value yields one leaf; a composite object value (typography) yields one leaf per\nsub-property named `&lt;token&gt;-&lt;subProperty&gt;`; array values (box-shadow lists) are skipped."

#: packages/core/src/functions/cssSyntaxForValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sniff the CSS `@property` `syntax` a concrete token should register under. Tokens Studio\n`type`s don't map 1:1 to CSS syntax, so the value is inspected. Returns `\"*\"` (universal) for\nanything that isn't a single, computationally-independent typed token."
msgstr "判斷具體 token 應該登記到哪個 CSS `@property` `syntax`。Tokens Studio\n`type`s 不會與 CSS 語法 1:1 對應，故須檢查其值。對於任何非單一、計算上獨立的類型化 token，會回傳 `\"*\"`（通用）。"

#: packages/core/src/functions/cssSyntaxForValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A concrete value (no `var()` / `light-dark()`)."
msgstr "具體值（無 `var()` / `light-dark()`）。"

