#: packages/core/src/functions/referenceToVarName.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Map a Tokens Studio reference body (the text inside `{…}`) to the CSS custom-property name of\nthe token it points at. A leading `semantic.` discriminates the semantic layer from primitives."
msgstr "將 Tokens Studio 參照主體（位於 `{…}` 內的文字）對應到該參照所指向的 token 的 CSS 自訂屬性名稱。\n前置的 `semantic.` 用以將語義層與原始類型區分開來。"

