#: packages/core/src/functions/runIconPlugins.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Run every plugin's `icons` hook, letting plugins register extra glyphs as `<image>` tokens.\nEach hook receives the current icon list and returns new [IconEntry](../interfaces/IconEntry.md) records to add.\nThe result is de-duplicated by name."
msgstr "Run every plugin's `icons` hook, letting plugins register extra glyphs as `&lt;image&gt;` tokens.\nEach hook receives the current icon list and returns new [IconEntry](../interfaces/IconEntry.md) records to add.\nThe result is de-duplicated by name."

