#: packages/core/src/functions/toStyleDictionary.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shape the resolved IR as a flat Style Dictionary token dictionary keyed by token name (with the\nleading `--` stripped). Feed this to `tools/sd-config` for the native emitters."
msgstr "將已解析的 IR 形塑為以 token 名稱為鍵的平面 Style Dictionary 代幣字典（會移除開頭的 `--`）。\n將此輸出提供給 `tools/sd-config` 以供原生 emitters 使用。"

