msgid "`@pantoken/core` — the pantoken transformer."
msgstr "`@pantoken/core` — pantoken 的轉換器。"

#: packages/core/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Defines the uniform plugin contract ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)) and adapts the resolved token IR for\nthe native lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md)). The upstream-resolving transform (`buildTokens`,\nwhich needs the GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`) lives on the separate\n`@pantoken/core/build` entry so this main entry stays free of that exotic dependency."
msgstr "定義統一的外掛合約 ([PantokenPlugin](interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)))，並將解析後的 token IR 適配為原生 lineage ([toStyleDictionary](functions/toStyleDictionary.md)))。負責上游解析的轉換器 (`buildTokens`,\nwhich needs the GitHub-only `@instructure/instructure-design-tokens`)) 被放在單獨的\n`@pantoken/core/build` 條目中，因而本主要條目得以免於那個特殊的相依。"

