msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Self-containment check: `--instui-*` names referenced via `var()` in a stylesheet that it never\ndefines (as an `@property` registration or a `--x:` declaration). Sorted; empty means every\nreference resolves within the same output. Use for self-contained stylesheets (css, pendo)."
msgstr "自包含性檢查：`--instui-*` 名稱透過 `var()` 在樣式表中被參考，但該樣式表從未\n將其定義（作為 `@property` 註冊或 `--x:` 宣告）。已排序；空值表示每個\n參考都在相同輸出中解析。用於自包含的樣式表（css、pendo）。"

