msgstr "元件樣式表。對於 `theme`/`mode`，預設為 [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md)。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "字型樣式表。預設為 [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "腳本。預設為 [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated comment strings. Defaults to [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."
msgstr "已翻譯的註解字串。預設為 [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "從 CDN 載入的單一檔案，以 npm 套件名稱和其內部路徑識別。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "npm 套件名稱，例如 `\"@pantoken/components\"`。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "套件內的路徑，例如 `\"dist/components.css\"`。省略則參照套件根目錄。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "僅為此檔案覆蓋提供者/建置層級的版本。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "對於預設會轉換 JS 的提供者（如 esm.sh）：`false` 允許提供者套用其正常的\nESM 轉換（此步驟為了 `import` 真正的套件進入點所需）。預設為 `true` — 原封不動提供檔案，這對於像 CSS 樣式表和 IIFE 捆綁等已預建/非 ESM 資產是必要的。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CDN that can serve npm package files. Providers never hardcode a package name — they only\nknow how to shape a URL from a [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."
msgstr "可提供 npm 套件檔案的 CDN。提供者永遠不會硬編碼套件名稱——他們只知道如何從一個 [CdnFile](CdnFile.md) 組成 URL。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stable identifier, e.g. `\"jsdelivr\"`."
msgstr "穩定的識別符，例如 `\"jsdelivr\"`。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable name, e.g. `\"jsDelivr\"`."
msgstr "可供人閱讀的名稱，例如 `\"jsDelivr\"`。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl) is implemented."
msgstr "是否已實作 [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl)。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the URL for a single file."
msgstr "為單一檔案建立 URL。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds one URL that serves multiple files concatenated together. Required iff `supportsCombine`."
msgstr "建立一個同時提供多個檔案（串接在一起）的 URL。僅當 `supportsCombine` 時才需要。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/ThemeStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The translatable strings baked into theme.css/theme.js's comments."
msgstr "內嵌在 theme.css/theme.js 註解中的可翻譯字串。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/type-aliases/ThemeMode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode — ignored for the `canvas`/`canvasHighContrast` variants."
msgstr "重新品牌化代幣模式 — 對 `canvas`/`canvasHighContrast` 變體會被忽略。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/type-aliases/ThemeVariant.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pantoken token theme variant."
msgstr "pantoken 的 token 主題變體。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/CDN_PROVIDERS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Providers available out of the box, keyed by [CdnProvider.id](../interfaces/CdnProvider.md#id)."
msgstr "開箱即用的提供者，鍵為 [CdnProvider.id](../interfaces/CdnProvider.md#id)。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_CDN_PROVIDER_ID.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The provider used when none is specified."
msgstr "未指定時使用的提供者。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_CSS_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets, combined into theme.css's first `@import` where the provider allows it."
msgstr "元件樣式表，在提供者允許的情況下合併到 theme.css 的第一個 `@import`。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s) — always loaded as their own `@import`(s), separate from the component styles."
msgstr "字體樣式表 — 總是以它們自己的 `@import`(s) 載入，與元件樣式分開。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s) theme.js injects via `<script>` tags."
msgstr "Script(s) theme.js injects via `&lt;script&gt;` tags."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "English defaults, used for any key a caller's `strings` override doesn't supply."
msgstr "英文預設值，當呼叫者的 `strings` 覆蓋未提供某個鍵時使用。"

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/generateCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Compose Kotlin for a named theme. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "為指定名稱的主題匯出 Compose Kotlin。回傳已寫入的檔案路徑。"

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Compose Kotlin for an explicit token IR. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "針對明確的 token IR 輸出 Compose Kotlin。回傳已寫入的檔案路徑。"

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with a custom object name**"
msgstr "**帶有自訂物件名稱的深色模式**"

#: platforms/compose/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/compose` — emit Instructure design tokens as Jetpack Compose (Kotlin), via Style\nDictionary. It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values and keeps the natively-typed\ntokens (colours, dimensions, numbers)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/compose` — 將 Instructure 設計代幣以 Jetpack Compose (Kotlin) 格式輸出，透過 Style\nDictionary。它會將 IR 平坦化為具體的單一模式值，並保留原生類型的代幣（顏色、尺寸、數值）。"

#: platforms/compose/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateCompose](functions/generateCompose.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新導出 [generateCompose](functions/generateCompose.md)"

#: platforms/compose/src/interfaces/GenerateComposeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateCompose](../functions/generateCompose.md) / [toCompose](../functions/toCompose.md)."
msgstr "用於 [generateCompose](../functions/generateCompose.md) / [toCompose](../functions/toCompose.md) 的選項。"

#: platforms/compose/src/interfaces/GenerateComposeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The generated Kotlin object name (default `PanTokens`)."
msgstr "產生的 Kotlin 物件名稱（預設為 `PanTokens`）。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/machineName.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert a display name to a Drupal machine name (`lower_snake`)."
msgstr "將顯示名稱轉換為 Drupal 機器名稱 (`lower_snake`)。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the files for a Drupal sub-theme that loads the Instructure tokens."
msgstr "建立用於載入 Instructure tokens 的 Drupal 子佈景主題檔案。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme files, paths relative to the theme directory."
msgstr "佈景主題檔案，其路徑相對於佈景主題目錄。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build and write a standalone sub-theme**"
msgstr "**建立並寫入獨立子佈景主題**"

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build a sub-theme on top of a base theme**"
msgstr "**在基底佈景主題上建立子佈景主題**"

#: platforms/drupal/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/drupal` — emit an Instructure-themed Drupal sub-theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/drupal` — 產生一個以 Instructure 為主題的 Drupal 子佈景主題。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Produces the token stylesheet (from `@pantoken/css`) and an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`, styling content in a `.pantoken-prose` region), plus the `*.info.yml`\nand `*.libraries.yml` a Drupal 10/11 theme needs to load them. Drop the files into\n`themes/custom/<machine>/`."
msgstr "Produces the token stylesheet (from `@pantoken/css`) and an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`, styling content in a `.pantoken-prose` region), plus the `*.info.yml`\nand `*.libraries.yml` a Drupal 10/11 theme needs to load them. Drop the files into\n`themes/custom/&lt;machine&gt;/`."

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/DrupalFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A generated file: a theme-relative path and its contents."
msgstr "一個生成的檔案：主題相對路徑及其內容。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/ToDrupalThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [toDrupalTheme](../functions/toDrupalTheme.md)."
msgstr "針對 [toDrupalTheme](../functions/toDrupalTheme.md) 的選項。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/ToDrupalThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme's human-readable name (default `\"Instructure\"`)."
msgstr "主題的人類可讀的名稱（預設 `\"Instructure\"`）。"

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/ToDrupalThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base theme (default `false` — a standalone theme)."
msgstr "基底主題（預設 `false` — 一個獨立的主題）。"

#: platforms/email/src/functions/emailTokens.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Select the token map for a mode (default `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "選擇某個模式的 token 對照表（預設 `\"light\"`）。"

#: platforms/email/src/functions/emailTokens.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inline a token into an email cell (light mode)**"
msgstr "**將 token 內嵌到電子郵件儲存格中（淺色模式）**"

#: platforms/email/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/email` — Instructure design tokens for HTML email."
msgstr "`@pantoken/email` — 用於 HTML 郵件的 Instructure 設計代幣。"

#: platforms/email/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Email clients don't support CSS custom properties and often strip `<style>`, so tokens are fully\nresolved to concrete values for inline styling. Colours are hex; dimensions keep their `px` units.\nIcons are excluded. `light`/`dark` maps are keyed by camelCased token name."
msgstr "Email clients don't support CSS custom properties and often strip `&lt;style&gt;`, so tokens are fully\nresolved to concrete values for inline styling. Colours are hex; dimensions keep their `px` units.\nIcons are excluded. `light`/`dark` maps are keyed by camelCased token name."

#: platforms/email/src/variables/dark.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Concrete `dark`-mode token values."
msgstr "具體的 `dark` 模式代幣值。"

#: platforms/email/src/variables/light.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Concrete `light`-mode token values, for inline email styling."
msgstr "具體的 `light`-mode token 值，用於內嵌電子郵件樣式。"

#: platforms/flutter/src/functions/generateFlutter.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Flutter Dart for a named theme. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "為具名主題輸出 Flutter Dart。回傳已寫入的檔案路徑。"

#: platforms/flutter/src/functions/toFlutter.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Flutter Dart for an explicit token IR. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "對明確的 token IR 輸出 Flutter Dart。回傳寫入的檔案路徑。"

#: platforms/flutter/src/functions/toFlutter.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with SVG icon assets and manifest**"
msgstr "**深色模式，含 SVG 圖示資產與清單**"

#: platforms/flutter/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/flutter` — emit Instructure design tokens as Flutter (Dart), via Style Dictionary. It\nflattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values and keeps the natively-typed tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/flutter` — 發出 Instructure 設計代幣為 Flutter (Dart)，透過 Style Dictionary。它\n將 IR 平坦化為具體、單一模式的值，並保留原生類型的代幣。"

#: platforms/flutter/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateFlutter](functions/generateFlutter.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [generateFlutter](functions/generateFlutter.md)"

#: platforms/flutter/src/interfaces/GenerateFlutterOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateFlutter](../functions/generateFlutter.md) / [toFlutter](../functions/toFlutter.md)."
msgstr "供 [generateFlutter](../functions/generateFlutter.md) / [toFlutter](../functions/toFlutter.md) 使用的選項。"

#: platforms/flutter/src/interfaces/GenerateFlutterOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The generated Dart class name (default `PanTokens`)."
msgstr "產生的 Dart 類別名稱（預設 `PanTokens`）。"

#: platforms/flutter/src/interfaces/GenerateFlutterOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names to also copy as SVG assets + a `PanTokensIcons` Dart manifest (for `flutter_svg`)."
msgstr "要同時複製為 SVG 資產的圖示名稱，以及一個 `PanTokensIcons` Dart 清單（用於 `flutter_svg`）。"

#: platforms/hugo/src/functions/toHugoAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the token asset files for a Hugo site (paths relative to the site root)."
msgstr "為 Hugo 站點構建 token 資產檔案（路徑相對於站點根目錄）。"

#: platforms/hugo/src/functions/toHugoAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Sass partial (`assets/scss/_pantoken.scss`), the plain stylesheet\n(`assets/css/pantoken.css`), and the prose stylesheet (`assets/css/pantoken-prose.css`)."
msgstr "Sass partial (`assets/scss/_pantoken.scss`)、純樣式表\n(`assets/css/pantoken.css`)，以及散文樣式表 (`assets/css/pantoken-prose.css`)。"

#: platforms/hugo/src/functions/toHugoAssets.md
#: platforms/jekyll/src/functions/toJekyllAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Write the assets under a site root**"
msgstr "**將資產寫入站點根目錄下**"

#: platforms/hugo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/hugo` — emit the Instructure token stylesheet for a Hugo site."
msgstr "`@pantoken/hugo` — 為 Hugo 站點匯出 Instructure 代幣樣式表。"

#: platforms/hugo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hugo has no standard theming-variable contract, so this delivers the tokens as drop-in assets\nunder `assets/` (where Hugo Pipes / Dart Sass pick them up): a Sass partial and a plain CSS file\n(from `@pantoken/scss` and `@pantoken/css`), plus an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`) that styles content in a `.pantoken-prose` region."
msgstr "Hugo 沒有標準的主題變數契約，因此將代幣以即插即用資產的形式放在 `assets/` 下（Hugo Pipes / Dart Sass 會在此擷取）：一個 Sass partial 與一個純 CSS 檔案（來自 `@pantoken/scss` 與 `@pantoken/css`），以及一份具 InstUI 外觀的正文樣式表（來自 `@pantoken/components`），用以為 `.pantoken-prose` 區域內的內容加上樣式。"

#: platforms/hugo/src/interfaces/HugoFile.md
#: platforms/jekyll/src/interfaces/JekyllFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A generated file: a site-relative path and its contents."
msgstr "已生成的檔案：網站相對路徑及其內容。"

#: platforms/jekyll/src/functions/toJekyllAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the token asset files for a Jekyll site (paths relative to the site root)."
msgstr "為 Jekyll 站點建構 token 資產檔案（路徑相對於站點根目錄）。"

#: platforms/jekyll/src/functions/toJekyllAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Sass partial (`_sass/pantoken.scss`), the plain stylesheet\n(`assets/css/pantoken.css`), and the prose stylesheet (`assets/css/pantoken-prose.css`)."
msgstr "Sass partial (`_sass/pantoken.scss`)、純樣式表\n(`assets/css/pantoken.css`)，以及正文樣式表 (`assets/css/pantoken-prose.css`)。"

#: platforms/jekyll/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/jekyll` — emit the Instructure token stylesheet for a Jekyll site."
msgstr "`@pantoken/jekyll` — 為 Jekyll 網站匯出 Instructure 代幣樣式表。"

#: platforms/jekyll/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Jekyll has no standard theming-variable contract, so this delivers the tokens as drop-in assets:\na Sass partial for `_sass/` (import it from your main stylesheet) and a plain CSS file for\n`assets/css/` (from `@pantoken/scss` and `@pantoken/css`), plus an InstUI-look prose stylesheet\n(from `@pantoken/components`) that styles content in a `.pantoken-prose` region."
msgstr "Jekyll 沒有標準的主題變數契約，因此本套件以可直接替換的資產方式提供這些 tokens：\n一個供 `_sass/` 使用的 Sass partial（從你的主要樣式表匯入）以及一個用於\n`assets/css/` 的純 CSS 檔案（來源於 `@pantoken/scss` 和 `@pantoken/css`），再加上一個具有 InstUI 風格的文章樣式表\n（來源於 `@pantoken/components`），用以在 `.pantoken-prose` 區域內樣式化內容。"

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/generateRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Rust constants for a named theme (using the vendored `@pantoken/tokens` IR)."
msgstr "為具名主題匯出 Rust 常數（使用隨附的 `@pantoken/tokens` IR）。"

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Rust constants for an explicit token IR."
msgstr "為明確的 token IR 輸出 Rust 常數。"

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Rust source (a module of `pub const`s)."
msgstr "Rust 原始程式碼（由 `pub const`s 組成的模組）。"

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**egui (Color32), the default format**"
msgstr "**egui (Color32)，預設格式**"

#: platforms/rust/src/functions/toRust.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
