#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/alpha.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set a color's opacity to `percent`% — the CSS-only mirror of ui-color-utils `alpha`. Mixing with\n`transparent` yields exactly the color at that alpha channel."
msgstr "將顏色的不透明度設定為 `percent`% — ui-color-utils 的僅 CSS 對應 `alpha`。與\n`transparent` 混合會精確產生該 alpha 通道的顏色。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/alpha.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base color (literal, `var(--token)`, or a nested helper result)."
msgstr "基本顏色（字面值、`var(--token)` 或巢狀輔助結果）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/alpha.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target opacity, 0–100."
msgstr "目標不透明度，0–100。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/alpha.md
#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `color-mix()` expression."
msgstr "一個 `color-mix()` 表達式。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/darken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Darken by `percent` HSL-lightness points — the CSS-only mirror of ui-color-utils `darken`\n(tinycolor lowers HSL lightness). Uses relative color syntax so hue and saturation are preserved."
msgstr "將 HSL 亮度降低 `percent` 點 — ui-color-utils `darken` 的純 CSS 對應實作\n（tinycolor 會降低 HSL 的亮度）。使用相對色彩語法以保留色相與飽和度。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/darken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "In relative `hsl()`, the `l` channel resolves to a `<number>` on the 0–100 scale — the same scale\ntinycolor's `amount` uses — so the points are subtracted directly (no `%`)."
msgstr "In relative `hsl()`, the `l` channel resolves to a `&lt;number&gt;` on the 0–100 scale — the same scale\ntinycolor's `amount` uses — so the points are subtracted directly (no `%`)."

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/darken.md
#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/lighten.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base color."
msgstr "基礎顏色。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/darken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lightness points to subtract (default `10`, matching tinycolor's default)."
msgstr "要減去的亮度點數（預設 `10`，與 tinycolor 的預設相符）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/darken.md
#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/lighten.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An `hsl(from …)` relative-color expression."
msgstr "一個 `hsl(from …)` 相對色彩表達式。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/lighten.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lighten by `percent` HSL-lightness points — the CSS-only mirror of ui-color-utils `lighten`\n(tinycolor raises HSL lightness). Uses relative color syntax so hue and saturation are preserved."
msgstr "將 HSL 明度提高 `percent` 點 — ui-color-utils `lighten` 的僅 CSS 對應實作\n（tinycolor 提升 HSL 明度）。使用相對色彩語法以保留色相與飽和度。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/lighten.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lightness points to add (default `10`, matching tinycolor's default)."
msgstr "要增加的明度點數（預設 `10`，與 tinycolor 的預設相符）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The readable foreground — black or white — for content placed *on* `surface`. This is the CSS-only\nform of InstUI's recurring `*-on-color` variants (a focus ring on a brand button, a\nprimary-inverse button's text, an icon on a coloured surface): rather than a fixed inverse token,\nit picks the contrast from the surface itself, so it stays correct as the surface changes."
msgstr "可讀的前景色 — 黑或白 — 用於置於 `surface` 上的內容。這是僅以 CSS 實作的 InstUI 常見 `*-on-color` 變體（例如品牌按鈕的聚焦環、primary-inverse 按鈕的文字、彩色表面上的圖示）：它不是用固定的反向 token，而是從表面本身選擇對比色，因此當表面改變時仍會保持正確。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It reads the surface's OKLCH lightness through relative color syntax and snaps it to `0` (black) or\n`1` (white) at `threshold` using the `calc(… * infinity)` clamp trick — no JS, no fixed hex."
msgstr "透過相對色彩語法讀取表面的 OKLCH 亮度，並在 `threshold` 以 `calc(… * infinity)` 的 clamp 技巧將其捲動到 `0`（黑）或 `1`（白）——無需 JS、無需固定的十六進位色碼。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The background colour content sits on (literal, `var(--token)`, or a nested helper)."
msgstr "字面值、`var(--token)`，或巢狀的輔助項目上所放置的背景色內容。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "OKLCH lightness (0–1) above which the surface counts as \"light\" (default `0.62`)."
msgstr "當 OKLCH 亮度（0–1）高於此值時，該表面即被視為「淺色」（預設為 `0.62`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/onColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An `oklch(from …)` expression resolving to black or white."
msgstr "一個解析為黑色或白色的 `oklch(from …)` 表達式。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flatten `overlay` (at `percent`% strength) over an opaque `base` — a CSS-only stand-in for\nui-color-utils `overlayColors`. That helper source-over-composites two RGBA colors into one opaque\nresult; the common case (a translucent tint over a solid surface) is exactly a two-color\n`color-mix()`. General RGBA-over-RGBA compositing can't be a single CSS color, so this covers the\nopaque-base case only."
msgstr "將 `overlay`（以 `percent`% 強度）平鋪於一個不透明的 `base` 上──作為 ui-color-utils `overlayColors` 的純 CSS 代替品。該輔助函式以 source-over 方式將兩個 RGBA 顏色合成為一個不透明的\n結果；常見情況（半透明色調覆蓋在實體表面上）正好是一個由兩色組成的\n`color-mix()`。一般的 RGBA 對 RGBA 合成無法表示為單一 CSS 顏色，因此此處僅涵蓋不透明底色的情形。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opaque background color."
msgstr "不透明的背景顏色。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The color laid over it."
msgstr "覆蓋在其上的顏色。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How much of `overlay` shows through, 0–100 (default `50`)."
msgstr "有多少 `overlay` 顯現出來，範圍 0–100（預設 `50`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-colors` — CSS-only color math that mirrors the InstUI `@instructure/ui-color-utils`\nhelpers (`alpha`, `darken`, `lighten`, `overlayColors`)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-colors` — 僅限 CSS 的色彩運算，模仿 InstUI 的 `@instructure/ui-color-utils`\nhelpers（`alpha`, `darken`, `lighten`, `overlayColors`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI computes those at build time with `tinycolor2` against concrete hex values. pantoken emits\n`var(--instui-*)` references that resolve in the browser (often through `light-dark()`), so the\nmath has to happen in CSS instead. Each helper returns a CSS color string built from\n[`color-mix()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/color_value/color-mix) and\n[relative color syntax](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_colors/Relative_colors) —\nboth Baseline modern-browser features — so a single expression tracks the token even when it's a\nscheme-dependent `light-dark()` pair. Use them wherever you'd otherwise hard-code a derived shade."
msgstr "InstUI 在建置時以 `tinycolor2` 對具體的十六進位值進行計算。pantoken 發出可在瀏覽器中解析的\n`var(--instui-*)` 參照（通常透過 `light-dark()`），因此運算必須改由 CSS 來完成。每個 helper 回傳由\n[`color-mix()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/color_value/color-mix) 與\n[相對色彩語法](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_colors/Relative_colors) 所建構的 CSS 色彩字串——兩者都是現代瀏覽器的基本功能——因此即使標記是由配色方案決定的 `light-dark()` 配對，單一表達式也能追蹤該 token。當你本來會硬編派生色階時，就使用它們。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/type-aliases/CssColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CSS color: a literal (`#1d354f`, `rebeccapurple`), a `var(--token)`, or a nested helper result."
msgstr "一個 CSS 顏色：一個字面值 (`#1d354f`, `rebeccapurple`)、一個 `var(--token)`，或是嵌套的輔助函式結果。"

#: plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/functions/bannerRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the banner layout CSS (doc comment + rules), substituting `prefix` for the `pfx-` sentinel.\nDefaults to `\"instui-\"` for the shipped stylesheet; pass `\"\"` for an unprefixed build."
msgstr "建立橫幅版面 CSS（文件註解 + 規則），將偵測符號 `pfx-` 替換為 `prefix`。\n預設已隨套件提供的樣式表使用 `\"instui-\"`；若要產生無前綴的建置，請傳入 `\"\"`。"

#: plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/functions/cardRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the card layout CSS (doc comment + rules), substituting `prefix` for the `pfx-` sentinel.\nDefaults to `\"instui-\"` for the shipped stylesheet; pass `\"\"` for an unprefixed build."
msgstr "建立卡片佈局的 CSS（文件註解 + 規則），將 `pfx-` 哨兵替換為 `prefix`。\n對於隨附的樣式表預設為 `\"instui-\"`；若要產生未加前綴的建置，請傳入 `\"\"`。"

#: plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/functions/customComponents.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the custom-components plugin."
msgstr "建立 custom-components 插件。"

#: plugins/pantoken/custom-components/src/functions/customComponents.md
#: plugins/pantoken/logos/src/functions/logosPlugin.md
#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/functions/visualDebug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
