#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/functions/primitivesCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the primitive utility stylesheet. Colors get the same `bg`/`fg`/`border` shape as the semantic\ncolor utilities, but keyed on the primitive token name (`.<prefix>-bg-primitive-color-white`); font\nprimitives map to their one property via the shared token-to-class transformer. Every class only ever\npoints at a real `--instui-primitive-*` token — no arbitrary values."
msgstr "Build the primitive utility stylesheet. Colors get the same `bg`/`fg`/`border` shape as the semantic\ncolor utilities, but keyed on the primitive token name (`.&lt;prefix&gt;-bg-primitive-color-white`); font\nprimitives map to their one property via the shared token-to-class transformer. Every class only ever\npoints at a real `--instui-primitive-*` token — no arbitrary values."

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw pantoken primitive palette (`--instui-primitive-*`)."
msgstr "供選擇性加入的工具類別，對應 pantoken 的原始調色盤 (`--instui-primitive-*`)。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The semantic utilities in `@pantoken/components` deliberately expose only semantic tokens — a color\noverride there is always a role (`bg-brand`), never a raw swatch. This package is the escape hatch:\none class per primitive token for the rare case a developer needs the palette directly. Load it on\nits own (`@pantoken/plugin-primitives/primitives.css`), separate from the semantic layer."
msgstr "`@pantoken/components` 中的語義工具刻意僅公開語義代幣——那裡的顏色覆寫始終是一個角色（`bg-brand`），而非原始色票。此套件為應急方案：為每個原始代幣提供一個類別，以應付開發者偶爾需要直接使用調色盤的情況。請獨立載入它（`@pantoken/plugin-primitives/primitives.css`），與語義層分離。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build the primitive stylesheet**"
msgstr "建立原始樣式表"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [primitivesCss](functions/primitivesCss.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新導出 [primitivesCss](functions/primitivesCss.md)"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/interfaces/PrimitiveTokenNames.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full primitive token names per family (e.g. `\"--instui-primitive-color-white\"`)."
msgstr "每個家族的完整原始代幣名稱（例如 `\"--instui-primitive-color-white\"`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/interfaces/PrimitiveTokenNames.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`--instui-primitive-color-*` — emitted as `bg`/`fg`/`border` utilities."
msgstr "`--instui-primitive-color-*` — 以 `bg`/`fg`/`border` 實用程式輸出。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/interfaces/PrimitiveTokenNames.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`--instui-primitive-font-family-*` — emitted as `font-family` utilities."
msgstr "`--instui-primitive-font-family-*` — 以 `font-family` 實用程式輸出。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/interfaces/PrimitiveTokenNames.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`--instui-primitive-font-weight-*` — emitted as `font-weight` utilities."
msgstr "`--instui-primitive-font-weight-*` — 以 `font-weight` 實用程式輸出。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/interfaces/PrimitivesOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [primitivesCss](../functions/primitivesCss.md)."
msgstr "提供給 [primitivesCss](../functions/primitivesCss.md) 的選項。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/interfaces/PrimitivesOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class prefix. A truthy string namespaces every class (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`); any falsy\nvalue drops the prefix entirely (`.bg-…`). The shipped `primitives.css` is built with `\"instui\"`."
msgstr "類別前綴。若為真值字串，會為每個類別命名空間（`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`）；任何假值\n都會完全移除該前綴（`.bg-…`）。隨附的 `primitives.css` 是使用 `\"instui\"` 構建的。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/functions/defaultRegistry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lazily import the `simple-icons` package as a [SimpleIconsRegistry](../type-aliases/SimpleIconsRegistry.md)."
msgstr "將 `simple-icons` 套件以延遲載入的方式匯入為 [SimpleIconsRegistry](../type-aliases/SimpleIconsRegistry.md)。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/functions/defaultRegistry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `simple-icons` module's `si*` exports."
msgstr "來自 `simple-icons` 模組的 `si*` 匯出。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/functions/defaultRegistry.md
#, no-c-format
