msgstr "**將延遲載入的註冊表傳入 token hook**"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/functions/simpleIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the Simple Icons plugin."
msgstr "建立 Simple Icons 外掛。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/functions/simpleIcons.md
#, no-c-format
