msgid "[SimpleIconsOptions](../interfaces/SimpleIconsOptions.md). Pass a `registry` to avoid the lazy import (e.g. in\n  token-stage use, where hooks are synchronous)."
msgstr "[SimpleIconsOptions](../interfaces/SimpleIconsOptions.md)。傳入 `registry` 以避免延遲匯入（例如在\n  token-stage 使用，hooks 為同步）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/functions/simpleIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [PantokenPlugin](../../../../../packages/core/src/interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md) with `tokens` and `rehype` hooks."
msgstr "具有 `tokens` 與 `rehype` 鉤子的 [PantokenPlugin](../../../../../packages/core/src/interfaces/PantokenPlugin.md)。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/functions/simpleIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Emit brand glyphs as \\<image\\> tokens**"
msgstr "**將品牌字形以 \\<image\\> 代幣輸出**"

