msgid "Convert a slug (`\"github-actions\"`) to its Simple Icons export name (`\"siGithubActions\"`)."
msgstr "將 slug (`\"github-actions\"`) 轉換為其 Simple Icons 匯出名稱 (`\"siGithubActions\"`)。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-simple-icons` — bring Simple Icons brand glyphs into pantoken."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-simple-icons` — 將 Simple Icons 的品牌字形匯入 pantoken。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin defines a `tokens` hook (emit selected brand glyphs as `<image>` tokens, so they flow\nto CSS and native too) *and* a `rehype` hook (resolve `:brand:` codes at render). Same plugin,\neither layer — the generalized form of the `mcp-stack/portal` icon factory."
msgstr "The plugin defines a `tokens` hook (emit selected brand glyphs as `&lt;image&gt;` tokens, so they flow\nto CSS and native too) *and* a `rehype` hook (resolve `:brand:` codes at render). Same plugin,\neither layer — the generalized form of the `mcp-stack/portal` icon factory."

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [simpleIcons](functions/simpleIcons.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新導出 [simpleIcons](functions/simpleIcons.md)"

