#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Brand slugs to emit as `<image>` tokens at the token layer (default: none)."
msgstr "Brand slugs to emit as `&lt;image&gt;` tokens at the token layer (default: none)."

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/interfaces/SimpleIconsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Simple Icons registry (default: the `simple-icons` package, loaded lazily)."
msgstr "Simple Icons 登錄表（預設：`simple-icons` 套件，採延遲載入）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/interfaces/SimpleIconsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The token-name prefix (default: `--instui-icon-`)."
msgstr "代幣名稱的前綴（預設：`--instui-icon-`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/simple-icons/src/type-aliases/SimpleIconsRegistry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Simple Icons registry: the module's named `si*` exports, or any compatible map."
msgstr "一個 Simple Icons 註冊表：模組中名為 `si*` 的匯出，或任何相容的映射。"

#: plugins/pantoken/stacking/src/functions/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the stacking tokens plugin."
msgstr "建立 stacking tokens 外掛。"

#: plugins/pantoken/stacking/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-stacking` — named z-index depths."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-stacking` — 命名的 z-index 深度。"

#: plugins/pantoken/stacking/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI's `View` exposes a stacking scale (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) so layers stack\npredictably instead of by hand-tuned magic numbers. This plugin emits `--instui-stacking-<level>`\ntokens, resolved to concrete z-index values from the shipped `--instui-component-view-stacking-*`\ntokens, for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css`/`@pantoken/tokens` pipeline directly.\nThe matching `.instui-stack-<level>` utility classes now live in `@pantoken/components`' own\n`stacking` utility."
msgstr "InstUI's `View` exposes a stacking scale (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) so layers stack\npredictably instead of by hand-tuned magic numbers. This plugin emits `--instui-stacking-&lt;level&gt;`\ntokens, resolved to concrete z-index values from the shipped `--instui-component-view-stacking-*`\ntokens, for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css`/`@pantoken/tokens` pipeline directly.\nThe matching `.instui-stack-&lt;level&gt;` utility classes now live in `@pantoken/components`' own\n`stacking` utility."

#: plugins/pantoken/stacking/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [stacking](functions/stacking.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [stacking](functions/stacking.md)"

#: plugins/pantoken/stacking/src/interfaces/StackingOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the [stacking](../functions/stacking.md) plugin."
msgstr "適用於 [stacking](../functions/stacking.md) 外掛的選項。"

#: plugins/pantoken/stacking/src/interfaces/StackingOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme whose shipped IR seeds reference resolution (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "其隨附 IR 種子之參考解析所使用的主題（預設 `\"rebrand\"`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/stacking/src/variables/STACKING_LEVELS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stacking depths, deepest → topmost, from InstUI's view stacking scale."
msgstr "來自 InstUI 的視圖堆疊刻度的堆疊深度，從最深層 → 最上層。"

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/functions/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the transition tokens plugin."
msgstr "建立 transition tokens 外掛。"

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-transition` — the `--instui-transition-duration`/`--instui-transition-timing`\ntokens behind InstUI's `Transition` utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-transition` — InstUI 的 `Transition` 工具背後的 `--instui-transition-duration`/`--instui-transition-timing` 設計代幣。"

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS itself (the `.instui-transition` base rule plus the `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*` state classes)\nlives in `@pantoken/components`' own `transition` utility now; this plugin only bakes the two\nduration/timing tokens into a token IR for consumers using the lower-level `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens` pipeline directly."
msgstr "CSS 本身（`.instui-transition` 基本規則加上 `fade`/`scale`/`slide-*` 狀態類別）\n目前位於 `@pantoken/components` 自身的 `transition` 實用工具中；此外掛僅將這兩個\n持續/時序 tokens 烘焙進 token IR，供直接使用較低層 `@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/tokens` 管線的使用者消費。"

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [transition](functions/transition.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [transition](functions/transition.md)"

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/interfaces/TransitionOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the [transition](../functions/transition.md) plugin."
msgstr "此為 [transition](../functions/transition.md) 插件的選項。"

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/interfaces/TransitionOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default: InstUI's `300ms`)."
msgstr "動畫持續時間（預設值：InstUI 的 `300ms`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/transition/src/interfaces/TransitionOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Timing function (default: InstUI's `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "緩動函數（預設值：InstUI 的 `ease-in-out`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/functions/visualDebug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the visual-debug plugin."
msgstr "建立 visual-debug 外掛。"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/functions/visualDebugRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-with-visual-debug` outline rules for a given outline `color` (default the bright magenta fallback)."
msgstr "`-with-visual-debug` 為指定的 `color` 定義輪廓規則（預設為亮洋紅色的備援）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-visual-debug` — the CSS for InstUI's `withVisualDebug` prop."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-visual-debug` — InstUI 的 `withVisualDebug` 屬性的 CSS。"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI's layout primitives (View, Flex, Grid, List, …) take `withVisualDebug` to outline the box\nand its children while debugging a layout. This plugin emits a single dash-prefixed modifier,\n`-with-visual-debug`, that works on any element (compound with any base, e.g.\n`.instui-view -with-visual-debug`). The outline colour is a `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` custom property\n(default a bright magenta) so it's easy to retint."
msgstr "InstUI 的佈局基元（View、Flex、Grid、List、…）接受 `withVisualDebug`，用於在除錯佈局時描繪該盒子及其子元素的輪廓。\n此外掛輸出一個單一的短橫線前綴修改器，\n`-with-visual-debug`，可在任何元素上使用（可與任何基底複合，例如\n`.instui-view -with-visual-debug`）。輪廓顏色是一個 `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` 自訂屬性\n（預設為鮮豔品紅），因此很容易重新著色。"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [visualDebug](functions/visualDebug.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [visualDebug](functions/visualDebug.md)"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/interfaces/VisualDebugOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the [visualDebug](../functions/visualDebug.md) plugin."
msgstr "為 [visualDebug](../functions/visualDebug.md) 插件的選項。"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/interfaces/VisualDebugOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The debug outline colour (default: a bright magenta via `--pantoken-visual-debug-color`)."
msgstr "除錯外框顏色（預設：透過 `--pantoken-visual-debug-color` 使用鮮豔的洋紅色）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/visual-debug/src/variables/VISUAL_DEBUG_RULES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-with-visual-debug` rules at the default outline colour, for the standalone `visual-debug.css` sheet."
msgstr "在獨立的 `visual-debug.css` 工作表中，`-with-visual-debug` 規則以預設輪廓顏色呈現。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property\ndeclarations."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-flatten-property` — 將 `@property` at-rules 轉換為純自訂屬性宣告。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@property` at-rules register typed CSS custom properties with `syntax`, `inherits`, and\n`initial-value` descriptors. They carry significant byte overhead — ~60 bytes of boilerplate per\nproperty — and are unnecessary when the stylesheet is a self-contained bundle where type\nregistration provides no runtime benefit. This plugin replaces each `@property` block with a\nsimple `--name: value` declaration inside a chosen selector, recovering all that overhead."
msgstr "`@property` at-rules 使用 `syntax`、`inherits` 與 `initial-value` 描述子來註冊型別化的 CSS 自訂屬性。它們會帶來顯著的位元組額外負擔——每個屬性約有 60 bytes 的樣板——而且當樣式表是自包含的捆綁檔，型別註冊在執行時並無益處時就不是必要的。此外掛會把每個 `@property` 區塊替換成放在選定選擇器內的簡單 `--name: value` 宣告，回收所有那些額外開銷。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Semantic note:** removing `@property` loses CSS type registration. Typed transitions/animations,\n`@starting-style`, and the CSS Typed OM depend on it. Only apply to bundles where those semantics\nare not needed."
msgstr "**語意註記：** 移除 `@property` 會失去 CSS 型別註冊。型別化的過渡/動畫、`@starting-style`，以及 CSS Typed OM 都依賴此註冊。僅在那些不需要這些語意的捆綁檔上套用。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md)."
msgstr "針對 [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) 的選項。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The selector of the rule that receives the extracted `--name: value` declarations."
msgstr "接收被擷取的 `--name: value` 宣告之規則的選擇器。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What to do with an `@property` at-rule that has no `initial-value` descriptor."
msgstr "當 `@property` at-rule 沒有 `initial-value` 描述子時的處理方式。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"remove\"` — drop the at-rule (default).\n- `\"keep\"` — leave it in the output untouched."
msgstr "- `\"remove\"` — 移除該 at-rule（預設）。\\n- `\"keep\"` — 保留於輸出中，不做變更。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the flatten-`@property` PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "建立 flatten-`@property` 的 PostCSS 外掛。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Walks all `@property` at-rules in the stylesheet, extracts each `initial-value` descriptor, removes\nthe at-rule, and prepends a single `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` rule containing all\nextracted declarations. Empty rules and `@layer` blocks left behind after removal are dropped."
msgstr "遍歷樣式表中的所有 `@property` at-rules，擷取每一個 `initial-value` 描述子，移除\n該 at-rule，並在前端插入一個包含所有\n擷取到的宣告的單一 `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` 規則。移除後遺留的空規則與 `@layer` 區塊會被丟棄。"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Default injection into :root**"
msgstr "**預設注入至 :root**"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inject into :scope (for use inside scope blocks)**"
msgstr "**注入至 :scope（供 scope 區塊內使用）**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — 將長的自訂屬性名稱重新命名為最小的順序識別符。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "像 `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` 這類的代幣名稱對人類可讀，但在壓縮後的套件中很昂貴：名稱本身就有 40+ 位元組，會在定義中重複出現、每次 `var()` 呼叫中出現，\n以及每次 `@property` 註冊時出現。此外掛會將每個匹配的名稱（跨定義、`var()` 參考，以及 `@property` 參數）替換為最小的識別符（`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`, …），將名稱開銷減少約 90%。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "名稱會從整個樣式表收集，按字母順序排序以取得確定性對應，然後依序指派。一個 [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) 選項允許多個獨立的 PostCSS 執行共用一致的對應，因此將會一起載入的分別處理的 CSS 檔案，可以安全地使用相同名稱進行混淆。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "關於 [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) 的選項。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "只有以此字串開頭的自訂屬性名稱會被混淆。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "用來產生短替代名稱的演算法。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, …（預設；對大量集合最短）\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, …（字母數字）\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "當 `true` 時，處理後會在 PostCSS 的 `result.messages` 中附加一個 `mangle-map` 條目。\n該訊息的形狀為 `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "可變的 `Map`，在多個 PostCSS 過程中共享。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "每一次處理過程，外掛會讀取既有條目（重複使用它們的短名稱）並寫入新的條目\n（從 `sharedManifest.size` 繼續計數）。將相同的 `Map` 實例傳給\n每個處理會一起在瀏覽器中載入的 CSS 檔案的 `mangleCustomProps` 或 `applyMinify` 呼叫——這能保證所有檔案使用相同的名稱對應。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "先處理 token 工作表，讓其名稱先被種入清單（manifest），然後元件工作表再加入它們（通常是重疊的）參考。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "用於 [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) 的短名稱生成策略。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "建立 mangle-custom-properties PostCSS 外掛。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "從宣告屬性、`var()` 參考，和 `@property` 參數中，收集所有符合 `prefix` 的自訂屬性名稱。\n將它們按字母順序排序以建立穩定且確定性的對應，然後使用所選的 `method` 指派短名稱。取代整個樣式表中的每一處出現。"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**使用預設混淆（--instui-\\\\*, base26）**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**在一起載入的兩個檔案之間共用對應表**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**使用 base36 名稱並透過 result.messages 輸出對應表**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "將自訂屬性最小化轉換套用到樣式表字串。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "從 `options` 建構一個 PostCSS 外掛陣列並同步執行。外掛順序：\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. 若未設定任何選項，則回傳原始輸入不變。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "要轉換的樣式表字串。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "轉換後的 CSS 字串。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — 透過單一 [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) 工具，為\n`--instui-*` 自訂屬性組合 prune、flatten 與 mangle 轉換。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "每個輸出 CSS 的流程（產生腳本、渲染器）都使用 `applyMinify` 以取得一致的\n壓縮介面，且不直接依賴 PostCSS。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Prune + mangle 僅在自包含的套件中安全**，此類套件中所有 `var(--instui-*)` 的引用\n及其定義都存在於相同輸出。對於分檔消費者（`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` 獨立載入），僅套用 `{ flatten: true }`。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**跨檔案邊界進行 Mangle：** 將相同的 `Map` 實例作為\n`mangle.sharedManifest` 傳入每個同時處理被一起載入的 CSS 檔案的 `applyMinify` 呼叫。\n先處理 token 表（它會為 manifest 提供種子），再處理元件表。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**對自包含套件套用這三種轉換**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**僅套用 Flatten（對分檔消費者安全）**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**用相同映射 Mangle 兩個檔案**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "適用於 [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md) 的選項。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "在其他轉換之前，套用 [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) 以對未使用的 `--instui-*` 代幣進行 tree-shake。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "僅在包含代幣定義與參考它們之元件\n規則的自包含套件中安全。修剪僅含代幣的樣式表會移除所有內容。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "套用 [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) 將 `@property` at-rules 轉換為一般宣告。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` 使用外掛預設值（`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`）。\n傳入 [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) 物件來覆寫個別預設。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "套用 [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) 將冗長的 `--instui-*` 名稱替換為最小化的識別符。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` 使用外掛預設值（`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`）。\n傳入 [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) 物件來覆寫個別預設 — 包括用於跨檔案協調的\n`sharedManifest`。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "僅在自包含套件中安全。請參閱模組級文件。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "建立 prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS 外掛程式。"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Run it as a standalone PostCSS pass**"
msgstr "**作為獨立的 PostCSS 執行階段執行它**"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties from a composed\nstylesheet."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — 對組合的樣式表進行 tree-shake，移除未使用的自訂屬性。"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 icon data-URIs\nincluded). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of the system would\notherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting from the `var()`\nreferences in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps only the custom\nproperties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` registrations."
msgstr "pantoken 的 `@pantoken/css` 會輸出整套 `--instui-*` 代幣集合（包含約 1,800 個圖示 data-URI）。建立在該層之上的渲染器若只樣式化系統的一小部分，否則會連整套一起打包 — 因此任何此類渲染器都需要此功能。從實際（非自訂屬性）宣告中的 `var()` 參考開始，它會傳遞式地保留實際可達的自訂屬性，並移除相符但未使用的 `@property` 註冊。"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The factory returns a\nplain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency — `postcss` is only\na type."
msgstr "這是一個獨立的 PostCSS 外掛（請在自己的 PostCSS 管線中執行）。工廠函式回傳一個純外掛物件，故匯入此模組不會帶入執行時相依 — `postcss` 僅為一個型別。"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n(`@media (theme: <name>)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit concrete CSS for a\nchosen target theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n(`@media (theme: &lt;name&gt;)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit concrete CSS for a\nchosen target theme."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin expands built-in `--theme-*` and `--breakpoint-*` aliases, prunes non-target theme\nbranches, strips matching `theme:*` clauses from kept queries, unwraps always-true theme-only media\nwrappers, and removes `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` declarations from emitted CSS."
msgstr "該外掛會展開內建的 `--theme-*` 和 `--breakpoint-*` 別名，修剪非目標主題\n分支，從保留的查詢中移除匹配的 `theme:*` 子句，展開始終為真的僅主題媒體\n包裝器，並自輸出的 CSS 中移除 `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` 宣告。"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [themeCustomMedia](variables/themeCustomMedia.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for the theme custom-media plugin."
msgstr "theme custom-media 插件的選項。"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/interfaces/ThemeCustomMediaOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target theme to emit (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "要輸出的目標主題（預設 `\"rebrand\"`）。"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/type-aliases/Theme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A theme the plugin can target when emitting concrete CSS."
msgstr "插件在輸出具體 CSS 時可針對的主題。"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the theme custom-media lowering plugin."
msgstr "建立主題 custom-media 降級外掛。"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/variables/themeCustomMedia.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Supports authoring with either direct theme custom-idents in media features (for example,\n`(theme: canvas)`) or built-in `@custom-media --theme-*` aliases."
msgstr "支援以兩種方式撰寫：在媒體特性中直接使用主題 custom-idents（例如，\n`(theme: canvas)`）或使用內建的 `@custom-media --theme-*` 別名。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/load.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "TypeDoc entry point. Registers a resolve-time pass that rewrites `@demo` tags into demo fences."
msgstr "TypeDoc 入口點。註冊一個解析時的處理程序，將 `@demo` 標籤重寫為示例程式碼區塊。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/load.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The TypeDoc application."
msgstr "TypeDoc 應用程式。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Move every `@demo` block tag on a comment into `demo` fences appended to its summary, in order.\nBlock-tag content gets re-fenced by the markdown theme, so the fence must live in the summary\nprose, which is emitted verbatim."
msgstr "將評論中每個 `@demo` 區塊標籤移入附加到其摘要的 `demo` 圍欄，並保持順序。\n區塊標籤的內容會被 Markdown 佈景主題重新加上圍欄，因此圍欄必須位於摘要\n的說明文字中，而該說明會逐字輸出。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The comment to rewrite in place."
msgstr "要就地改寫的評論。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/toDemoFence.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap one demo spec in a fenced `demo` block."
msgstr "將一個示範規格包在一個有圍欄的 `demo` 程式碼區塊中。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/toDemoFence.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A demo spec: a bare URL or a `<provider>:<ref>` pair."
msgstr "A demo spec: a bare URL or a `&lt;provider&gt;:&lt;ref&gt;` pair."

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/toDemoFence.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The fenced code block as a string."
msgstr "作為字串的有圍欄程式碼區塊。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` — a TypeDoc plugin for the `@demo` block tag."
msgstr "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` — TypeDoc 的 `@demo` 區塊標籤的外掛。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Authors attach a live, embeddable demo to any symbol with `@demo <spec>`, where `<spec>` is either\na bare URL or a `<provider>:<ref>` pair (for example `stackblitz:abc123`, `codesandbox:xy12z`,\n`wp-playground:https://…/blueprint.json`, or `self:button`). This plugin registers nothing about\nproviders itself — it stays deliberately dumb and reusable: it moves each `@demo` tag's spec into\na fenced `demo` block appended to the symbol's summary, and your docs renderer decides how to\nturn a spec into an iframe. (See `@pantoken/demo` for a renderer that resolves the providers.)"
msgstr "Authors attach a live, embeddable demo to any symbol with `@demo &lt;spec&gt;`, where `&lt;spec&gt;` is either\na bare URL or a `&lt;provider&gt;:&lt;ref&gt;` pair (for example `stackblitz:abc123`, `codesandbox:xy12z`,\n`wp-playground:https://…/blueprint.json`, or `self:button`). This plugin registers nothing about\nproviders itself — it stays deliberately dumb and reusable: it moves each `@demo` tag's spec into\na fenced `demo` block appended to the symbol's summary, and your docs renderer decides how to\nturn a spec into an iframe. (See `@pantoken/demo` for a renderer that resolves the providers.)"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The fence rides through markdown untouched — including any translation pipeline that preserves\ncode blocks — so the demo survives localization."
msgstr "程式碼 fence 會原封不動地通過 markdown — 包括任何會保留\n程式碼區塊的翻譯流程 — 因此示範在本地化後仍能保留。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Setup:** add `\"@demo\"` to TypeDoc's `blockTags` option. The comment parser reads that list before\nplugins load, so a plugin can't register the tag late enough to suppress the \"unknown block tag\"\nwarning; it must be in your `typedoc.json`."
msgstr "**設定：** 將 `\"@demo\"` 新增到 TypeDoc 的 `blockTags` 選項。註解解析器在\n外掛載入之前就讀取該清單，因此外掛無法晚到到足以壓制 \"未知的區塊標籤\"\n警告；它必須存在於你的 `typedoc.json` 中。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/variables/DEMO_FENCE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The fenced-code language the demo spec is emitted under — target it in your renderer."
msgstr "示例規格輸出所使用的 fenced-code 語言 — 在你的渲染器中以此為目標。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/variables/DEMO_TAG.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The block tag this plugin consumes. Register it in TypeDoc's `blockTags` so it won't warn."
msgstr "此插件所使用的區塊標籤。將其在 TypeDoc 的 `blockTags` 中註冊，這樣它就不會發出警告。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/functions/matchesFilters.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Returns `true` if the changed filename passes the node's include/ignore filters."
msgstr "如果變更的檔名通過 node 的 include/ignore 過濾器，則回傳 `true`。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — a Vite dev-server plugin that watches upstream workspace\npackages and rebuilds them (and their dependents) when source changes."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vite-workspace-orchestrator` — 一個 Vite 開發伺服器插件，監視上游工作區套件，當原始碼變更時重建它們（以及其相依套件）。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "During development, changes to a local workspace package normally need a manual rebuild before the\ndev server reflects them. This plugin automates that: it watches each upstream package's source\nwith native `fs.watch` (not Vite's chokidar, which filters paths outside the project root),\ndebounces rapid changes, rebuilds in topological order, and registers built output with Vite's\nwatcher so the browser reloads. In pantoken's docs it keeps the generated CSS (`@pantoken/css`,\n`@pantoken/components`) fresh as you edit the libraries, instead of only at build time."
msgstr "在開發期間，本地工作區套件的變更通常需要手動重建，開發伺服器才會反映這些變更。此插件自動化該流程：它使用原生 `fs.watch`（非 Vite 的 chokidar，因為後者會過濾專案根目錄外的路徑）來監視每個上游套件的原始碼，對快速變更做去抖動（debounce），以拓撲順序重建，並將建置輸出註冊到 Vite 的 watcher，使瀏覽器重新載入。在 pantoken 的文件中，它可在你編輯函式庫時保持產生的 CSS（`@pantoken/css`、`@pantoken/components`）為最新，而不僅限於建置時。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It applies during `serve` only, so production builds are untouched."
msgstr "它僅在 `serve` 期間套用，因此不會影響生產環境的建置。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/FileServerEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One static file-serving middleware entry."
msgstr "一個靜態檔案服務中介軟體條目。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/FileServerEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "URL path prefix to mount the middleware at, e.g. `\"/styles/apps\"`."
msgstr "掛載此中介軟體的 URL 路徑前綴，例如 `\"/styles/apps\"`。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/FileServerEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Local directory to serve files from."
msgstr "用於提供檔案的本地目錄。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/FileServerEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only serve files whose URL path ends with this extension, e.g. `\".css\"`."
msgstr "僅提供 URL 路徑以此副檔名結尾的檔案，例如 `\".css\"`。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/FileServerEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Value for the `Content-Type` response header."
msgstr "`Content-Type` 回應標頭的值。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/FileServerEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional transform applied to the URL-relative path before resolving against `serveDir`, e.g.\n`(p) => p.replace(//([^/]+)\\.css$/, \"/$1/app.css\")`."
msgstr "在相對於 URL 的路徑對 `serveDir` 進行解析之前，可選套用的轉換，例如\n`(p) => p.replace(//([^/]+)\\.css$/, \"/$1/app.css\")`。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [workspaceOrchestrator](../functions/workspaceOrchestrator.md)."
msgstr "針對 [workspaceOrchestrator](../functions/workspaceOrchestrator.md) 的選項。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream workspace dependency graph."
msgstr "上游工作區相依關係圖。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Paths to watch with native `fs.watch` so Vite picks up built output after an upstream rebuild\n(e.g. a package's `dist` or `generated` directory). Uses native `fs.watch` rather than\nchokidar's `add()`, which doesn't reliably detect changes in pnpm-symlinked or out-of-root\ndirectories. On each change a synthetic `\"change\"` event is emitted on `server.watcher`: for\nCSS files already in the module graph Vite triggers a targeted hot-update; for anything else\nit falls back to a full page reload."
msgstr "使用原生 `fs.watch` 要監視的路徑，以便在上游重建後 Vite 能拾取已建置的輸出（例如套件的 `dist` 或 `generated` 目錄）。使用原生 `fs.watch` 而不是 chokidar 的 `add()`，因為後者無法可靠偵測 pnpm 符號連結或 root 外目錄的變更。每次變更時會在 `server.watcher` 上發出合成的 `\"change\"` 事件：對於已在模組圖中的 CSS 檔案，Vite 會觸發針對性的熱更新；對於其他檔案則會回退為整頁重新載入。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Debounce delay in milliseconds before triggering a rebuild (default: 200)."
msgstr "在觸發重建前的去抖延遲（以毫秒為單位，預設：200）。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional static file-serving middleware entries."
msgstr "可選的靜態檔案服務中介軟體條目。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One upstream workspace package to watch and rebuild."
msgstr "一個要監視並重新建置的上游工作區套件。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display name for log messages."
msgstr "用於日誌訊息的顯示名稱。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Package root directory (the cwd for the build command)."
msgstr "套件根目錄（建置命令的當前工作目錄）。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Paths (files or directories) to watch — directories are watched recursively."
msgstr "要監視的路徑（檔案或目錄）— 目錄會遞迴監視。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build command: first element is the executable, the rest are arguments."
msgstr "建置命令：第一個元素為可執行檔，剩餘元素為參數。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names of other upstream nodes to rebuild after this one succeeds."
msgstr "此節點成功後要重新建置的其他上游節點名稱。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Glob patterns for files to include. When set, only changes to files matching at least one\npattern trigger a rebuild. Omit to include everything."
msgstr "要包含檔案的 Glob 模式。設定時，只有符合至少一個\n模式的檔案變更會觸發重新建置。省略則包含所有檔案。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/UpstreamNode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Glob patterns for files to ignore. Changes to matching files are silently skipped. Omit to\nignore nothing."
msgstr "要忽略檔案的 Glob 模式。符合的檔案變更會被靜默跳過。省略則不忽略任何檔案。"

#: renderers/angular/src/functions/readToken.md
#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/readToken.md
#: renderers/vue/src/functions/readToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read a resolved token value. Returns `fallback` on the server."
msgstr "讀取已解析的 token 值。伺服器端會回傳 `fallback`。"

#: renderers/angular/src/functions/register.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/register.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register the pantoken custom elements. No-op when there is no DOM (SSR / build), so this module\nis safe to import anywhere."
msgstr "註冊 pantoken 的自訂元素。當沒有 DOM（SSR / build）時為空操作，因此此模組\n可安全地在任何地方匯入。"

#: renderers/angular/src/functions/registerPantokenElements.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register the pantoken custom elements (call once during app bootstrap)."
msgstr "註冊 pantoken 自訂元素（在應用程式啟動期間呼叫一次）。"

#: renderers/angular/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/angular` — Angular helpers over `@pantoken/web-components`."
msgstr "`@pantoken/angular` — 針對 `@pantoken/web-components` 的 Angular 輔助工具。"

#: renderers/angular/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Call [registerPantokenElements](functions/registerPantokenElements.md) during bootstrap, and add `CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` to the\ncomponent/module that uses `<instui-icon>`. [readToken](functions/readToken.md) reads a resolved `--instui-*` value."
msgstr "Call [registerPantokenElements](functions/registerPantokenElements.md) during bootstrap, and add `CUSTOM_ELEMENTS_SCHEMA` to the\ncomponent/module that uses `&lt;instui-icon&gt;`. [readToken](functions/readToken.md) reads a resolved `--instui-*` value."

#: renderers/astro/src/functions/InstUI.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the pantoken Starlight plugin."
msgstr "建立 pantoken 的 Starlight 外掛。"

#: renderers/astro/src/functions/InstUI.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Starlight plugin that injects the pantoken stylesheet into the page head."
msgstr "一個會將 pantoken 的樣式表注入到頁面 head 中的 Starlight 外掛。"

#: renderers/astro/src/functions/InstUI.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**astro.config.mjs**"
msgstr "**astro.config.mjs**"

#: renderers/astro/src/functions/pantokenCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the pantoken stylesheet for a theme (with optional plugin CSS). Exposed for direct use."
msgstr "為主題建置 pantoken 樣式表（可選包含外掛 CSS）。供直接使用的對外介面。"

#: renderers/astro/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/astro` — Astro / Starlight integration for pantoken."
msgstr "`@pantoken/astro` — pantoken 的 Astro / Starlight 整合。"

#: renderers/astro/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[InstUI](functions/InstUI.md) is a Starlight plugin that injects the pantoken stylesheet (and any plugin CSS,\ne.g. a focus ring) into the page head. It ports the approach of `starlight-theme-instui` onto the\nshared `@pantoken/css` pipeline, so it no longer carries its own token resolver."
msgstr "[InstUI](functions/InstUI.md) 是一個 Starlight 外掛，將 pantoken 樣式表（以及任何外掛 CSS，\n例如 focus ring）注入到頁面 head。它將 `starlight-theme-instui` 的做法移植到共用的\n`@pantoken/css` 管線，因此不再攜帶自己的 token resolver。"

#: renderers/astro/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [InstUI](functions/InstUI.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [InstUI](functions/InstUI.md)"

#: renderers/astro/src/interfaces/HeadEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A minimal structural type for a Starlight head entry (avoids a hard dependency on Starlight)."
msgstr "用於 Starlight head 條目的最小化結構型別（避免對 Starlight 的強相依）。"

#: renderers/astro/src/interfaces/InstUIOptions.md
