msgstr "`@pantoken/docusaurus` — 使用 Instructure 代幣為 Docusaurus 站點套用主題。"

#: renderers/docusaurus/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Docusaurus styles come from Infima, whose theming is driven by `--ifm-*` CSS variables. This\npoints those at `var(--instui-*)`, so dropping the output into `src/css/custom.css` (alongside\n`@pantoken/css`, which defines the custom properties) re-skins the docs with the Instructure look\nwhile light/dark keeps flowing through the same tokens."
msgstr "Docusaurus 的樣式來自 Infima，其主題由 `--ifm-*` CSS 變數驅動。這些變數指向 `var(--instui-*)`，因此將輸出放入 `src/css/custom.css`（與定義自訂屬性的 `@pantoken/css` 並置）會用 Instructure 的外觀重新套用文件主題，同時淺色/深色模式仍透過相同的代幣持續運作。"

