#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/foundation` — theme Foundation for Sites with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — 為使用 Instructure 代幣的 Foundation for Sites 提供主題。"

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation 以 Sass 為主，因此此套件提供兩層。[toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) 會匯出一個\n`_settings` 風格的 Sass partial，將 Foundation 的設定變數指向 `var(--instui-*)`，如此一來\nSass 建置會產生 Instructure 的外觀，同時在執行時仍透過相同的自訂屬性維持主題化。[toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) 則匯出一個薄薄的 CSS 覆蓋層，會以相同方式為常見的已編譯類別（`.button`、`.callout`、連結）套用主題——當你使用原生的 Foundation CSS 並只想在不重新編譯的情況下套用 Instructure 顏色時，這會很有用。"

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
