#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A selector prefix to scope the overlay under (e.g. `.instui`); default: unscoped."
msgstr "用於將覆蓋層限定在某個選擇器下的前綴（例如 `.instui`）；預設：無範圍。"

#: renderers/foundation/src/interfaces/ToFoundationSettingsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [toFoundationSettings](../functions/toFoundationSettings.md)."
msgstr "用於 [toFoundationSettings](../functions/toFoundationSettings.md) 的選項。"

#: renderers/foundation/src/interfaces/ToFoundationSettingsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
