msgstr "供 [pantokenMarkdownIt](../functions/pantokenMarkdownIt.md) 使用的選項。"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An explicit icon resolver, tried after plugin resolvers and before the built-in set."
msgstr "一個明確的圖示解析器，在插件解析器之後、內建集合之前嘗試。"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Plugins whose `rehype` hooks contribute icon resolvers (tried first)."
msgstr "其 `rehype` 鉤子會提供圖示解析器的外掛（最先嘗試）。"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class applied to the icon wrapper (default: `pantoken-icon`)."
msgstr "套用到圖示包裝元素的 class（預設：`pantoken-icon`）。"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class applied to the color-swatch wrapper (default: `pantoken-color-swatch`)."
msgstr "套用到色票包裝元素的 class（預設：`pantoken-color-swatch`）。"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render `:icon:` codes as inline SVG (default: `true`)."
msgstr "將 `:icon:` 程式碼渲染為內嵌 SVG（預設：`true`）。"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
