msgstr "**Canvas 主題，未加作用域，保留完整的 token 集合**"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — 一個用於 Pendo 指南的 Instructure 風格全域樣式表。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs, and an `instui-banner` prefix extends the\nbanner surface to popovers and surveys while keeping their overlay elevation."
msgstr "Pendo 將導覽的 HTML 注入到宿主頁面；這會呈現該導覽的 DOM (`._pendo-*`) 以配合\nInstructure UI，使用 pantoken 的 `--instui-*` 代幣圖層來對齊。它包含響應式的\n紫色與海色橫幅導覽樣式，並與警示、彈出框、問卷與控制元件並列。該\n元件 CSS 已從 `@instructure/pendo-global-css` 移植；pantoken 提供代幣與\n組件。單一主題類別包含 `instui` 以啟用作用域樣式表；該類別上的緊湊型\n後綴用於選擇橫幅顏色與圖示，而一個 `instui-banner` 前綴則將\n橫幅表面延伸至彈出框與問卷，同時保留它們的覆蓋層高程。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) 組合樣式表；[pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) 是預先製作好的 `rebrand` 構建（已範圍化，`!important`）。一個靜態檔案發佈於 `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/AddScopeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [addScope](../variables/addScope.md)."
msgstr "適用於 [addScope](../variables/addScope.md) 的選項。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/AddScopeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The scope root selector (default `[class*=\"instui\"]._pendo-step-container`)."
msgstr "範圍根選擇器（預設為 `[class*=\"instui\"]._pendo-step-container`）。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildPendoCss](../functions/buildPendoCss.md)."
msgstr "用於 [buildPendoCss](../functions/buildPendoCss.md) 的選項。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Theme to source the `--instui-*` layer from (default `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "要從中取用 `--instui-*` 層的主題（預設為 `\"rebrand\"`）。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `@scope` root selector (default `[class*=\"instui\"]._pendo-step-container`)."
msgstr "`@scope` 的根選擇器（預設為 `[class*=\"instui\"]._pendo-step-container`）。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap component rules in `@scope` for DOM containment (default `true`)."
msgstr "將組件規則包裹在 `@scope` 中以實現 DOM 隔離（預設為 `true`）。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "在組件宣告中加入 `!important`，以便覆蓋 Pendo 的樣式（預設為 `true`）。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "對未使用的 `--instui-*` 代幣進行 tree-shake（預設為 `true`；關閉時會發佈完整代幣集）。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "透過\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) 將 `@property` at-rule 轉換為一般的自訂屬性宣告（預設為 `false`）。`true` 使用插件預設並搭配\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"`，因此宣告會置入 `@scope` 區塊內。\n傳入 [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) 物件可覆寫個別預設。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "透過 [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md) 將 `--instui-*` 名稱混淆成最小的 26 進位基底標識（預設為 `false`）。在此情況下是安全的，因為完整的代幣 + 組件樣式表為一個自包含的封包。傳入 [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) 物件可覆寫預設。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/COMPONENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The component CSS in cascade order (the `tokens` and `vars` layers are handled separately)."
msgstr "組件的 CSS 以層疊順序（`tokens` 與 `vars` 層分別處理）。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/LAYER_ORDER.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cascade order (lowest → highest). Layered `!important` beats Pendo's\nown unlayered `!important`, so guide styles stay on top."
msgstr "層疊順序（最低 → 最高）。分層的 `!important` 較 Pendo 的\n未分層 `!important` 優先，因而導覽樣式保持在最上方。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/addImportant.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the add-`!important` plugin."
msgstr "建立 add-`!important` 外掛。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/addScope.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the `@scope` wrapping plugin."
msgstr "建立 `@scope` 包裝外掛。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/pendoCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ready-made `rebrand` Pendo guide stylesheet (scoped, `!important`)."
msgstr "現成的 `rebrand` Pendo 指引樣式表（有作用域，`!important`）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/InstuiMarkdown.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render Markdown with Instructure UI element mappings and pantoken icon/color tokens."
msgstr "使用 Instructure UI 的元素對應以及 pantoken 的圖示/顏色代幣來呈現 Markdown。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/InstuiMarkdown.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Basic**"
msgstr "**Basic**"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/InstuiMarkdown.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**With brand icons via a plugin**"
msgstr "**透過外掛使用品牌圖示**"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/buildIconResolver.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the icon-resolver chain: plugin `rehype` resolvers first, then explicit `resolvers`, then\nthe built-in `@pantoken/icons` set. The first match wins."
msgstr "建立圖示解析器鏈：先使用外掛 `rehype` 解析器，接著是明確的 `resolvers`，然後是內建的 `@pantoken/icons` 集合。\n以第一個符合項為準。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/createInstuiMarkdownComponents.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the react-markdown component map for a set of render options."
msgstr "為一組渲染選項建立 react-markdown 的元件映射。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/createInstuiMarkdownComponents.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A react-markdown `components` map backed by Instructure UI."
msgstr "由 Instructure UI 支援的 react-markdown `components` 映射。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/createInstuiMarkdownComponents.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Pass the map straight to react-markdown**"
msgstr "**直接將映射傳給 react-markdown**"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/isColorValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "True when a string is a standalone CSS color value (hex or a color function)."
msgstr "當字串為獨立的 CSS 顏色值（十六進位或顏色函式）時回傳 true。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/parseAlertMarker.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Detect a GitHub alert marker at the start of text; returns the marker and the remaining text."
msgstr "偵測文本開頭的 GitHub 警示標記；回傳該標記與剩餘的文字。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/rehypeColorCodes.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin that wraps standalone color values in `<span data-color-code=\"…\">`, so the React\nlayer can render a swatch. Mirrors the icon-token pipeline."
msgstr "一個 rehype 外掛，將獨立的色彩值包裹在 `<span data-color-code=\"…\">` 中，讓 React\n層能夠呈現色樣。與 icon-token 管線相呼應。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/functions/rehypeGithubAlerts.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin that tags GitHub-alert blockquotes: it detects a `[!NOTE]`-style marker at the\nstart of a blockquote, records it as `data-alert=\"note\"`, and strips the marker text. The React\n`blockquote` component then renders an InstUI `Alert`."
msgstr "一個 rehype 插件，用於標記 GitHub 警示引用區塊：它會偵測到類似 `[!NOTE]` 的標記位於\n引用區塊的開頭，將其記錄為 `data-alert=\"note\"`，並移除該標記文字。React\n`blockquote` 元件然後渲染一個 InstUI 的 `Alert`。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/react-markdown` — render Markdown with Instructure UI components and pantoken icons."
msgstr "`@pantoken/react-markdown` — 使用 Instructure UI 元件和 pantoken 圖示來呈現 Markdown。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default entry renders GitHub-Flavored Markdown, inline `:icon:` tokens (via\n`@pantoken/rehype` + `@pantoken/icons`), color-code swatches, and GitHub-style alerts. The MDX\nprovider lives at `@pantoken/react-markdown/mdx`."
msgstr "預設的條目會呈現 GitHub 風格的 Markdown，內嵌的 `:icon:` 代幣（透過\n`@pantoken/rehype` + `@pantoken/icons`），色碼樣本，以及 GitHub 風格的警示。MDX\nprovider 位於 `@pantoken/react-markdown/mdx`。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Props for the [InstuiMarkdown](../functions/InstuiMarkdown.md) component."
msgstr "供 [InstuiMarkdown](../functions/InstuiMarkdown.md) component 使用的 props。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Markdown source."
msgstr "Markdown 原始來源。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
