msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render options that tune how Markdown maps onto Instructure UI."
msgstr "用於調整 Markdown 如何映射到 Instructure UI 的呈現選項。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Link behavior."
msgstr "連結行為。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show an external-link affordance on off-site links (default: true)."
msgstr "在站外連結上顯示外部連結提示（預設：true）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add permalink anchors to headings (default: false)."
msgstr "為標題新增永久連結錨點（預設：false）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Class name for permalink anchors (default: `pantoken-heading-anchor`)."
msgstr "永久連結錨點的類別名稱（預設： `pantoken-heading-anchor`）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fenced code block behavior."
msgstr "圍欄程式碼區塊的行為。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Preserve the language hint as a `data-language` attribute (default: true)."
msgstr "將語言提示保留為 `data-language` 屬性（預設：true）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline `:icon:` token behavior."
msgstr "內聯 `:icon:` 標記的行為。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enable `:icon:` rendering (default: true)."
msgstr "啟用 `:icon:` 呈現（預設：true）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "CSS color applied to rendered icons."
msgstr "套用到呈現圖示的 CSS 顏色。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra resolvers, tried before the built-in pantoken icon set."
msgstr "額外的解析器，會在內建 pantoken 圖示集之前嘗試。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Plugins whose `rehype` hooks contribute resolvers (e.g. simple-icons)."
msgstr "其 `rehype` 鉤子會提供解析器的外掛（例如 simple-icons）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline color-code swatches (e.g. `#03893D`)."
msgstr "內嵌色碼色票（例如 `#03893D`）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enable color swatches (default: true)."
msgstr "啟用色票（預設：true）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "GitHub-style blockquote alerts."
msgstr "GitHub 風格的引用區提示。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enable `> [!NOTE]` → InstUI Alert mapping (default: true)."
msgstr "啟用 `> [!NOTE]` → InstUI Alert 的對應（預設：true）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/interfaces/InstuiMarkdownRenderOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Caption used for rendered tables (required by InstUI Table for a11y)."
msgstr "用於呈現表格的說明文字（InstUI Table 為無障礙性所需）。"

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/type-aliases/AlertMarker.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "GitHub-style blockquote alert markers (`> [!NOTE]`)."
msgstr "GitHub 風格的引用區塊警示標記 (`> [!NOTE]`)."

#: renderers/react-markdown/src/variables/instuiMarkdownComponents.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default component map (no options)."
msgstr "預設元件映射（無選項）。"

#: renderers/react-native/src/functions/tokensForScheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Select the token object for a colour scheme (pair with RN's `useColorScheme`)."
msgstr "為色彩方案選擇代幣物件（與 RN 的 `useColorScheme` 配對）。"

#: renderers/react-native/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/react-native` — Instructure design tokens as React Native `StyleSheet`-friendly\nobjects. React Native has no CSS variables, so tokens are fully resolved to concrete values:\ncolours stay hex strings, dimensions become numbers (dp), and icons are excluded."
msgstr "`@pantoken/react-native` — 將 Instructure 設計代幣視為適用於 React Native `StyleSheet` 的物件。\nReact Native 沒有 CSS 變數，因此代幣會被完全解析為具體值：\n顏色維持為十六進位字串，尺寸轉為數字（dp），圖示則被排除。"

#: renderers/react-native/src/type-aliases/RNTokenValue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A React Native token value: a colour/string or a numeric dimension."
msgstr "React Native 代幣值：一個顏色/字串或數值尺寸。"

#: renderers/react-native/src/variables/dark.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `dark`-mode token object."
msgstr "該 `dark`-模式 的 token 物件。"

#: renderers/react-native/src/variables/light.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `light`-mode token object."
msgstr "此 `light`-mode 的 token 物件。"

#: renderers/react/src/functions/Icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render an Instructure icon as the `<instui-icon>` custom element."
msgstr "Render an Instructure icon as the `&lt;instui-icon&gt;` custom element."

#: renderers/react/src/functions/TokenProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register the pantoken custom elements (client-side) and render children."
msgstr "註冊 pantoken 自訂元素（客戶端）並渲染子元素。"

#: renderers/react/src/functions/readToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Read a resolved token value from the document. Returns `fallback` on the server."
msgstr "從文件中讀取已解析的代幣值。伺服器端返回 `fallback`。"

#: renderers/react/src/functions/useToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "React hook returning a resolved `--instui-*` token value (re-reads on `name` change)."
msgstr "React hook 回傳已解析的 `--instui-*` 代幣值（在 `name` 變更時重新讀取）。"

#: renderers/react/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/react` — thin React helpers over `@pantoken/web-components` and the token CSS."
msgstr "`@pantoken/react` — 在 `@pantoken/web-components` 與 token CSS 之上提供輕量的 React 輔助工具。"

#: renderers/react/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `<Icon>` renders the `<instui-icon>` custom element (React 19 passes props to custom elements).\n- `useToken` reads a resolved `--instui-*` value at runtime (SSR-safe: returns the fallback on\n  the server).\n- `<TokenProvider>` registers the elements and is where an app can inject the stylesheet."
msgstr "- `&lt;Icon&gt;` renders the `&lt;instui-icon&gt;` custom element (React 19 passes props to custom elements).\n- `useToken` reads a resolved `--instui-*` value at runtime (SSR-safe: returns the fallback on\n  the server).\n- `&lt;TokenProvider&gt;` registers the elements and is where an app can inject the stylesheet."

#: renderers/react/src/index.md renderers/svelte/src/index.md
#: renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Re-exports [register](../../angular/src/functions/register.md)"
msgstr "重新匯出 [register](../../angular/src/functions/register.md)"

#: renderers/react/src/index.md renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Re-exports [registerLocalized](../../svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md)"
msgstr "重新匯出 [registerLocalized](../../svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md)"

#: renderers/react/src/interfaces/IconProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Props for [Icon](../functions/Icon.md)."
msgstr "針對 [Icon](../functions/Icon.md) 的屬性。"

#: renderers/react/src/interfaces/TokenProviderProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Props for [TokenProvider](../functions/TokenProvider.md)."
msgstr "TokenProvider 的屬性。"

#: renderers/react/src/interfaces/TokenProviderProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag or a pre-built [LocaleBundle](#). When set, uses `registerLocalized`."
msgstr "BCP47 區域標籤或預先建立的 [LocaleBundle](#)。設定後，使用 `registerLocalized`。"

#: renderers/rehype/src/functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin factory. Returns a transformer that rewrites `:code:` tokens to inline SVG."
msgstr "一個 rehype 外掛工廠。回傳一個轉換器，將 `:code:` 標記重寫為內嵌 SVG。"

#: renderers/rehype/src/functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A unified/rehype transformer."
msgstr "一個 unified/rehype 轉換器。"

#: renderers/rehype/src/functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Built-in icon set**"
msgstr "**內建圖示集**"

#: renderers/rehype/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/rehype` — render `:icon:` codes as inline SVG."
msgstr "`@pantoken/rehype` — 將 `:icon:` 代碼渲染為內嵌 SVG。"

#: renderers/rehype/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin walks hast text nodes and replaces `:code:` tokens with an inline SVG element,\nresolving each code through a chain: plugin `rehype` resolvers first, then any explicit\n`resolve`, then the built-in `@pantoken/icons` set. It ports `rehype-instui-markdown` onto the\nshared icon manifest."
msgstr "該插件會遍歷 hast 的文字節點，並用內嵌 SVG 元素取代 `:code:` 代幣，\n按順序解析每個代碼：先使用插件的 `rehype` 解析器，接著任何明確的\n`resolve`，然後是內建的 `@pantoken/icons` 集合。它將 `rehype-instui-markdown` 匯入到\n共用圖示清單。"

#: renderers/rehype/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [rehypePantokenIcons](functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [rehypePantokenIcons](functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md)"

#: renderers/rehype/src/interfaces/RehypeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [rehypePantokenIcons](../functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md)."
msgstr "用於 [rehypePantokenIcons](../functions/rehypePantokenIcons.md) 的選項。"

#: renderers/rehype/src/interfaces/RehypeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class name applied to the emitted wrapper (default: `pantoken-icon`)."
msgstr "套用到輸出包裝器的類別名稱（預設：`pantoken-icon`）。"

#: renderers/shadcn/src/functions/toShadcnCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit the shadcn → Instructure CSS-variable bridge."
msgstr "輸出 shadcn → Instructure CSS 變數橋接."

#: renderers/shadcn/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/shadcn` — theme shadcn/ui with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/shadcn` — 使用 Instructure 代幣的 shadcn/ui 主題。"

#: renderers/shadcn/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[toShadcnCss](functions/toShadcnCss.md) emits a `:root` block pointing shadcn's CSS variables at `var(--instui-*)`.\nDrop it in alongside `@pantoken/css` (which defines the custom properties) and shadcn components\nadopt the Instructure look. Icons align for free — shadcn and Instructure both use Lucide."
msgstr "[toShadcnCss](functions/toShadcnCss.md) 會輸出一個 `:root` 區塊，將 shadcn 的 CSS 變數指向 `var(--instui-*)`。\n將它與 `@pantoken/css`（定義自訂屬性）放在一起，shadcn 元件即可採用 Instructure 的外觀。圖示會自動對齊 —— shadcn 與 Instructure 都使用 Lucide。"

#: renderers/shadcn/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [shadcnCss](variables/shadcnCss.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [shadcnCss](variables/shadcnCss.md)"

#: renderers/shadcn/src/interfaces/ToShadcnCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [toShadcnCss](../functions/toShadcnCss.md)."
msgstr "針對 [toShadcnCss](../functions/toShadcnCss.md) 的選項。"

#: renderers/shadcn/src/variables/SHADCN_TO_INSTUI.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "shadcn CSS variable → the Instructure token it resolves to."
msgstr "shadcn CSS 變數 → 它解析到的 Instructure token。"

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a Storybook theme from the Instructure tokens."
msgstr "從 Instructure tokens 建立 Storybook 主題。"

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`\"light\"` or `\"dark\"` (default `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "`\"light\"` 或 `\"dark\"`（預設為 `\"light\"`）。"

#: renderers/storybook/src/functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `ThemeVars`-shaped object."
msgstr "一個呈 `ThemeVars` 形狀的物件。"

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/storybook` — a Storybook theme built from Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/storybook` — 一個由 Instructure 代幣構建的 Storybook 主題。"

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) returns a plain `ThemeVars`-shaped object (so `@storybook/theming`\nstays an optional peer) with colours resolved concretely from the IR. Pass it to Storybook's\n`manager`/`preview` theme."
msgstr "[pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md) 回傳一個純粹、符合 `ThemeVars` 形狀的物件（因此 `@storybook/theming`\n仍為可選的同級項），其顏色由 IR 具體解析。將它傳遞給 Storybook 的\n`manager`/`preview` 主題。"

#: renderers/storybook/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [pantokenStorybookTheme](functions/pantokenStorybookTheme.md)"

#: renderers/storybook/src/type-aliases/StorybookTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Storybook theme object (a subset of `ThemeVars`)."
msgstr "一個 Storybook 主題物件 (`ThemeVars` 的子集)。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Svelte action: `<span use:icon={\"arrow-left\"} />` renders the icon's inline SVG into the node."
msgstr "Svelte 動作：`<span use:icon={\"arrow-left\"} />` 將圖示的內嵌 SVG 渲染到節點中。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The host element."
msgstr "宿主元素。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon name."
msgstr "圖示名稱。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register custom elements with locale-specific strings and direction."
msgstr "註冊自訂元素，並提供語系專屬的字串與文字方向。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](#) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](#) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "接受已完全解析的 [LocaleBundle](#) *或* 原始的 BCP47 標籤字串。當傳入字串時，\n[makeStrings](#) 會透過 `Intl.DateTimeFormat` 推斷星期名稱，其他所有字串\n則回退到英文；若要完整翻譯，請傳入 bundle。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](#) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "一個 [LocaleBundle](#) 物件，或一個 BCP47 標籤（`\"hu\"`、`\"ar\"`、…）。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The registry to define into (defaults to `globalThis.customElements`)."
msgstr "要定義到的註冊表（預設為 `globalThis.customElements`）。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Passed through to `register()` (e.g. `prefix`, `only`)."
msgstr "會傳遞給 `register()`（例如 `prefix`、`only`）。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/svelte` — Svelte helpers over `@pantoken/web-components`."
msgstr "`@pantoken/svelte` — 在 `@pantoken/web-components` 上的 Svelte 輔助工具。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`icon` is a Svelte action that renders an Instructure glyph into an element. `readToken` reads a\nresolved `--instui-*` value (SSR-safe). The custom elements also work directly once `register()`\nhas run."
msgstr "`icon` 是一個 Svelte action，會將 Instructure 字形呈現在元素中。`readToken` 會讀取已解析的\n`--instui-*` 值（SSR 安全）。自訂元素在 `register()`\n執行後也能直接運作。"

#: renderers/svelte/src/interfaces/ActionResult.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A Svelte action's return shape."
msgstr "Svelte action 的回傳結構。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createComponentsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the components picker plugin factory.\nReturns a function suitable for `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."
msgstr "建立元件選擇器插件工廠。\n回傳一個適用於 `tinymce.PluginManager.add()` 的函式。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createComponentsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage:\n  tinymce.PluginManager.add(\n    \"pantokenComponents\",\n    createComponentsPlugin(`{ model, currentAssets, onMissingAsset }`)\n  );"
msgstr "用法：\n  tinymce.PluginManager.add(\n    \"pantokenComponents\",\n    createComponentsPlugin(`{ model, currentAssets, onMissingAsset }`)\n  );"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createIconsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the icons picker plugin factory.\nReturns a function suitable for `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."
msgstr "建立圖示選擇器插件工廠。\n回傳一個適用於 `tinymce.PluginManager.add()` 的函式。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createLayoutsPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the `tinymce.PluginManager.add` callback for the \"Insert layout\" plugin."
msgstr "為「Insert layout」外掛建立 `tinymce.PluginManager.add` 回呼。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createLogosPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the logos picker plugin factory.\nReturns a function suitable for `tinymce.PluginManager.add()`."
msgstr "建立 logos picker 插件工廠。\n回傳一個適用於 `tinymce.PluginManager.add()` 的函式。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/createTemplatesPlugin.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the `tinymce.PluginManager.add` callback for the \"Insert template\" plugin."
msgstr "為 \"Insert template\" 外掛 建立 `tinymce.PluginManager.add` 回呼函式。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/findEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Find a component/utility/custom entry by name."
msgstr "按名稱尋找元件/實用程式/自訂項目。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/getIconCdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compute the CdnFile for an icon given its source.\nReturns `{ package, path }` for use with @pantoken/cdn's buildFileUrl."
msgstr "計算給定來源的圖示的 CdnFile。\n回傳 `{ package, path }`，以供 @pantoken/cdn 的 buildFileUrl 使用。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/getModifierSuggestions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Get all modifier suggestions for a component/utility, filtered by an optional prefix.\nReturns array of `{ name, prop, value?, description }` objects."
msgstr "取得元件/工具的所有修飾建議，可用選用的前綴進行過濾。\n回傳 `{ name, prop, value?, description }` 物件陣列。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/injectContentStylesheet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Appends a `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` to the editor's content document `<head>` at runtime.\nIdempotent per URL — calling this twice with the same `url` is a no-op the second time."
msgstr "Appends a `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` to the editor's content document `&lt;head&gt;` at runtime.\nIdempotent per URL — calling this twice with the same `url` is a no-op the second time."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/listComponents.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "List all components (kind: \"component\")."
msgstr "列出所有元件 (kind: \"component\")."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/listUtilities.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "List all utilities (kind: \"utility\")."
msgstr "列出所有實用程式 (kind: \"utility\")."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/loadAllIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Load and merge all available icons from both sources.\nReturns a sorted array tagged with the source package."
msgstr "載入並合併來自兩個來源的所有可用圖示。\n回傳一個已排序的陣列，並以來源套件標記。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/loadAllIcons.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "NOTE: Component icon names are derived from the model's `-icon-*` modifier.\nThis needs to be populated from either `docs/public/icon-manifest.json` (if consumable)\nor a manifest published alongside formats/components model.json.\nFor now, only simple-icons are included."
msgstr "注意：元件圖示名稱是由模型的 `-icon-*` 修飾子派生而來。\n這需要從 `docs/public/icon-manifest.json`（若可被消耗）或隨 formats/components model.json 一同發佈的清單填入。\n目前僅包含 simple-icons。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenContentCssUrls.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolves a set of [CdnFile](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md)s to URLs suitable for TinyMCE's `content_css` init option."
msgstr "將一組 [CdnFile](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md) 解析為適用於 TinyMCE 的 `content_css` 初始化選項的 URL。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenContentCssUrls.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "readonly [`CdnFile`](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md)[]"
msgstr "唯讀 [`CdnFile`](../../../../platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md)[]"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlCompletion.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create a CodeMirror 6 autocomplete extension for pantoken HTML.\nProvides completions for component names and their modifiers."
msgstr "為 pantoken HTML 建立一個 CodeMirror 6 的自動完成擴充套件。\n提供元件名稱及其修飾子之補全建議。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlCompletion.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage:\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlCompletion({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"
msgstr "用法：\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlCompletion({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlLinter.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create a CodeMirror 6 linter extension for pantoken HTML.\nValidates class attributes containing `.instui-*` tokens."
msgstr "為 pantoken HTML 建立一個 CodeMirror 6 的 linter 擴充套件。\n驗證包含 `.instui-*` 代幣的 class 屬性。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/pantokenHtmlLinter.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage:\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlLinter({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"
msgstr "使用方式：\n  new EditorView({\n    extensions: [\n      basicSetup,\n      html(),\n      pantokenHtmlLinter({ model }),\n    ],\n  });"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/functions/validateClassToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Validate a pantoken class token (e.g., \"instui-button\", \"instui-button.-color-primary\").\nReturns an array of validation errors (empty if valid)."
msgstr "驗證 pantoken 類別代幣（例如：\"instui-button\"、\"instui-button.-color-primary\"）。\n回傳一個驗證錯誤陣列（若有效則為空）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One documented CSS record: its base class plus everything derived from the CSS + doc comments."
msgstr "一個記錄化的 CSS 條目：其基礎類別以及從該 CSS 與文件註解衍生出的所有內容。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The record name from `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name`, e.g. `button`."
msgstr "從 `@component`/`@utility`/`@rule`/`@declaration`/`@name` 取得的記錄名稱，例如 `button`。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which kind of CSS surface this documents (defaults to `component`)."
msgstr "此文件所記錄的 CSS 類型（預設為 `component`）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base CSS selector — a class (`.button`), attribute (`[data-layout=\"x\"]`), ID (`#foo`),\n or shadow-DOM pseudo (`:host`) — inferred from the first bare-class rule or set explicitly via\n `@selector`. Always non-empty (falls back to `.${name}` when inference fails)."
msgstr "基礎 CSS 選擇器 — 一個類別（`.button`）、屬性（`[data-layout=\"x\"]`）、ID（`#foo`）\n或 shadow-DOM 偽元素（`:host`）— 從第一個裸類別規則推斷，或透過\n`@selector` 明確設定。始終非空（當推斷失敗時回退為 `.${name}`）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One-line summary from `@summary`."
msgstr "來自 `@summary` 的一行摘要。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extended prose from `@remarks`."
msgstr "來自 `@remarks` 的擴展敘述文字（長文）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Internal-only prose from `@privateRemarks` (emitters may choose to omit it from public output)."
msgstr "來自 `@privateRemarks` 的僅供內部使用的敘述（發行器可選擇從公開輸出中省略）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The release stage from a modifier flag tag (`@alpha`/`@beta`/`@experimental`/`@internal`/`@public`)."
msgstr "來自修飾標籤旗標的發行階段（`@alpha`/`@beta`/`@experimental`/`@internal`/`@public`）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Version introduced, from `@since`."
msgstr "引入版本，來自 `@since`。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A documentation group/category, from `@group`/`@category`."
msgstr "文件群組/類別，來自 `@group`/`@category`。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accessibility guidance, from `@a11y`/`@accessibility`."
msgstr "無障礙指引，來自 `@a11y`/`@accessibility`。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set when this record carries a `@global` tag — its modifiers (and per-modifier `@global` flags)\napply to any component/layout/rule/declaration, not just this record's base class. Used during\nvalidation and consumption checks to resolve modifier matches globally."
msgstr "當此記錄帶有 `@global` 標籤時設定 — 其修飾子（以及每修飾子的 `@global` 旗標）\n適用於任何元件/版面/規則/宣告，而不僅限於此記錄的基礎類別。用於驗證與消費檢查以全局解析修飾子匹配。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AST-extracted modifiers, annotated with `@modifier` prose where authored."
msgstr "由 AST 擷取的修飾子，並在作者撰寫時以 `@modifier` 敘述註記。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AST-extracted sub-element parts (class-based), annotated with `@part` prose where authored."
msgstr "由 AST 擷取的子元素部件（基於類別），並在作者撰寫時以 `@part` 敘述註記。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shadow-DOM exposed parts (`::part(name)`), from `@csspart` or a `::part()` selector."
msgstr "Shadow-DOM 可暴露的 parts（`::part(name)`），來自 `@csspart` 或 `::part()` 選擇器。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Native pseudo-elements the component styles (`::before`, `::marker`, …), from `@pseudo` or a selector."
msgstr "元件樣式的原生偽元素（`::before`, `::marker`, …），來自 `@pseudo` 或一個選擇器。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "States the component reacts to, from `@cssstate`, `:state()`, pseudo-classes, or state classes."
msgstr "元件會回應的狀態，來自 `@cssstate`, `:state()`, 偽類或狀態類別。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Named slots the component shell exposes, from `@slot`."
msgstr "元件殼體暴露的命名插槽，來自 `@slot`。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Allowed HTML elements from `@element` (default + optional named profiles)."
msgstr "允許的 HTML 元素，來自 `@element`（預設 + 可選命名配置）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Internal to-do notes, from `@todo` tags and `/* @todo … */` inline comments. Development notes,\nnot public API — emitters may omit them (like [CssDocEntry.privateRemarks](#privateremarks))."
msgstr "內部待辦註記，來自 `@todo` 標籤與 `/* @todo … */` 行內註解。為開發註記，非公開 API — 發行器可省略（如 [CssDocEntry.privateRemarks](#privateremarks)）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Design tokens this component consumes: every `--*` custom property referenced via `var(...)` inside\nits rules, each annotated with `@tokens` prose where authored (and including any `@tokens`-declared\ntoken not literally found via `var()`)."
msgstr "此元件使用的設計代幣：透過 `var(...)` 在其規則中被引用的所有 `--*` 自訂屬性，並在作者撰寫時以 `@tokens` 敘述註記（且包含任何由 `@tokens` 宣告但未透過 `var()` 字面找到的代幣）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom properties this component declares (`@property`) or documents (`@cssproperty`)."
msgstr "此元件宣告（`@property`）或記錄（`@cssproperty`）的自訂屬性。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "CSS custom functions (`@function`) this component defines."
msgstr "此元件定義的 CSS 自訂函式（`@function`）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animations (`@keyframes`) this component exposes."
msgstr "此元件公開的動畫（`@keyframes`）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cascade layers (`@layer`) this component participates in."
msgstr "此元件參與的 cascade 層（`@layer`）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Conditional-support blocks (`@container`/`@supports`/`@media`) the rules sit under."
msgstr "規則所屬的條件支援區塊（`@container`/`@supports`/`@media`）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@example` blocks, verbatim."
msgstr "`@example` 區塊，逐字。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The authored `@structure` element tree (top-level nodes), when present. When the `@structure` body\nuses `@variant` blocks (see [structureVariants](#structurevariants)), this holds the first variant's nodes only,\nfor back-compat with any code that hasn't been updated to read `structureVariants`."
msgstr "已撰寫的 `@structure` 元素樹（頂層節點），若存在。當 `@structure` 主體使用 `@variant` 區塊（見 [structureVariants](#structurevariants)）時，僅保留第一個變體的節點，為了與尚未更新以讀取 `structureVariants` 的程式碼相容。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alternative DOM shapes for this component, when the authored `@structure` body contains one or\nmore top-level `@variant` blocks — absent for the common case of a single, non-variant structure."
msgstr "此元件的替代 DOM 形狀，當已撰寫的 `@structure` 主體包含一個或多個頂層 `@variant` 區塊時存在 — 若為單一且無變體的結構則不存在。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional prose description leading the `@structure` body, when authored."
msgstr "在已撰寫時，作為 `@structure` 主體前導的可選敘述文字。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@demo <spec>` (e.g. `self:button`), when authored."
msgstr "`@demo &lt;spec&gt;` (e.g. `self:button`), when authored."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-level deprecation replacement text, when authored (the argument to a `@deprecated` tag)."
msgstr "元件層級的棄用替代文字，若已撰寫（作為 `@deprecated` 標籤的參數）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@see <ref>` cross-references."
msgstr "`@see &lt;ref&gt;` cross-references."

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Usage prose from `@usage` — how to include the stylesheet / use the component."
msgstr "來自 `@usage` 的使用說明文字 — 如何包含樣式表 / 使用該元件。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Local annotation legend rows from `@annotations`, in author order."
msgstr "來自 `@annotations` 的本地註解圖例列，按作者順序排列。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Local annotation references from `@ref`, in author order."
msgstr "來自 `@ref` 的本地註解引用，按作者順序排列。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Record-level object-model decorators."
msgstr "記錄層級的物件模型裝飾器（decorators）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Browser-support / feature-compatibility notes from `@compat`."
msgstr "來自 `@compat` 的瀏覽器支援 / 功能相容性註記。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Related components from `@related`."
msgstr "來自 `@related` 的相關元件。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Declared family membership from `@memberOf` — this record is a member of another named record,\noptionally `private` (must only ever appear inside that parent). Absent when not authored."
msgstr "來自 `@memberOf` 的宣告成員關係 — 此記錄為另一命名記錄的成員，\n可選地為 `private`（僅可出現在該父項內）。未撰寫時不存在。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Member record names from `@members` — the inverse direction, declared on the parent."
msgstr "來自 `@members` 的成員記錄名稱 — 反向方向，在父項上宣告。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured parent-side member declarations from repeated `@member` tags."
msgstr "來自重複 `@member` 標籤的結構化父側成員宣告。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Where the record was authored, when position info is available (for source links)."
msgstr "記錄被撰寫的位置，當位置資訊可用時（用於來源連結）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/CssDocEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Content of registered custom (block) tags, keyed by tag name without its `@`. Populated only for\ntags added via configuration; unregistered unknown tags are ignored. Absent when none were found."
msgstr "已登記的自訂（區塊）標籤的內容，鍵為標籤名稱但不含其 `@`。僅對透過設定新增的\n標籤進行填充；未註冊的未知標籤會被忽略。若未找到則不會出現。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/LayoutsPluginOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [createLayoutsPlugin](../functions/createLayoutsPlugin.md)."
msgstr "為 [createLayoutsPlugin](../functions/createLayoutsPlugin.md) 的選項。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/LayoutsPluginOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The page layouts offered in the \"Insert layout\" picker. Defaults to [pageLayouts](../variables/pageLayouts.md)."
msgstr "在「插入佈局」選擇器中提供的頁面佈局。預設為 [pageLayouts](../variables/pageLayouts.md)。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/LayoutsPluginOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Called after a layout is inserted (e.g. to refresh a live preview)."
msgstr "在佈局插入後呼叫（例如用於重新整理即時預覽）。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/interfaces/TaggedIcon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon with source attribution for tracking which package it comes from."
msgstr "具有來源歸屬的圖示，用於追蹤它來自哪個套件。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/variables/LAYOUTS_PLUGIN_NAME.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin name to pass in TinyMCE's `plugins`/`toolbar` init options."
msgstr "要在 TinyMCE 的 `plugins`/`toolbar` 初始化選項中傳入的插件名稱。"

#: renderers/tinymce/src/variables/LAYOUTS_TOOLBAR_NAME.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toolbar button/menu item name registered by this plugin."
msgstr "此外掛所註冊的工具列按鈕／選單項目名稱。"

#: renderers/vitepress/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vitepress` — theme a VitePress site with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vitepress` — 使用 Instructure 代幣為 VitePress 網站套用主題。"

#: renderers/vitepress/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "VitePress theming is driven by `--vp-*` CSS variables. This points them at `var(--instui-*)`, so\ndropping the output into `.vitepress/theme/custom.css` (alongside `@pantoken/css`, which defines\nthe custom properties) re-skins the docs with the Instructure look while light/dark keeps flowing\nthrough the same tokens."
msgstr "VitePress 的主題由 `--vp-*` CSS 變數驅動。這會將它們指向 `var(--instui-*)`，因此\n將輸出放入 `.vitepress/theme/custom.css`（以及定義自訂屬性的 `@pantoken/css`）會讓文件改成\nInstructure 的外觀，同時淺色/深色主題仍透過相同的代幣維持一致。"

#: renderers/vitepress/src/interfaces/ToVitePressCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for `toVitePressCss`."
msgstr "為 `toVitePressCss` 提供的選項。"

#: renderers/vitepress/src/variables/VITEPRESS_TO_INSTUI.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "VitePress CSS variable → the Instructure token it resolves to."
msgstr "VitePress CSS 變數 → 它解析到的 Instructure 代幣。"

#: renderers/vue/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve an icon name to inline SVG (empty string when unknown). Pure — the element renders it."
msgstr "將圖示名稱解析為內嵌 SVG（未知時為空字串）。純函式 — 元素會渲染它。"

#: renderers/vue/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon name (e.g. `arrow-left`)."
msgstr "圖示名稱（例如 `arrow-left`）。"

#: renderers/vue/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/iconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The resolver (defaults to the built-in pantoken icon set)."
msgstr "解析器（預設為內建的 pantoken 圖示集）。"

#: renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/vue` — a Vue plugin over `@pantoken/web-components`."
msgstr "`@pantoken/vue` — 一個基於 `@pantoken/web-components` 的 Vue 外掛。"

#: renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`install` registers the custom elements and tells Vue's compiler to treat `instui-*` tags as\ncustom elements. `readToken` reads a resolved `--instui-*` value (SSR-safe)."
msgstr "`install` 註冊自訂元素，並告訴 Vue 的編譯器將 `instui-*` 標籤視為\n自訂元素。 `readToken` 讀取已解析的 `--instui-*` 值（SSR 安全）。"

#: renderers/vue/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [PantokenVue](variables/PantokenVue.md)"
msgstr "重新命名並重新匯出 [PantokenVue](variables/PantokenVue.md)"

#: renderers/vue/src/variables/PantokenVue.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The pantoken Vue plugin: `app.use(PantokenVue)` or `app.use(PantokenVue, { locale: \"hu\" })`."
msgstr "The pantoken Vue plugin：`app.use(PantokenVue)` 或 `app.use(PantokenVue, { locale: \"hu\" })`。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the shared [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) a `register()`-style call threads to every element's\n`define`. The icon resolver is injectable: `register()` always passes the real,\n`@pantoken/icons`-backed [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (unchanged default behavior for every existing caller),\nwhile the per-element CDN build passes [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) for elements that never call it —\n`@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` is a multi-MB dependency, and since Rollup can't code-split\n`iife`/`umd` output, anything statically reachable from a bundle's entry ends up in the whole\nbundle, regardless of whether that specific element's code path ever invokes it. This module has no\ntop-level side effects for exactly that reason — importing it (unlike importing `../index.ts`, which\nauto-registers everything on import) never reaches [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) unless the caller passes it in."
msgstr "構建共享的 [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md)，作為一個 `register()` 式的呼叫線程，傳遞到每個元素的 `define`。圖示解析器是可注入的：`register()` 總是傳入真實的、以 `@pantoken/icons` 支持的 [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)（對於現有的每個呼叫者這是預設且不變的行為），而每個元素的 CDN 構建對於從不呼叫它的元素則傳入 [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) — `@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` 是個數 MB 的依賴，且由於 Rollup 無法對 `iife`/`umd` 的輸出進行程式碼拆分，任何從 bundle 入口靜態可達的東西都會成為整個 bundle 的一部分，不論該特定元素的程式路徑是否實際調用它。正因如此，本模組沒有頂層副作用 — 單純匯入它（不同於匯入 `../index.ts`，該匯入時會自動註冊所有東西）不會觸及 [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)，除非呼叫者將其傳入。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Same shape as `register()`'s options, minus `only`."
msgstr "與 `register()` 的選項形狀相同，但不含 `only`。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The registry to define into."
msgstr "要定義到的註冊表（registry）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The resolver wired into `ctx.iconSvg` — pass [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) for real icons\n  or [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) when the caller's element set provably never renders one (see\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` in `./elements-meta.ts`)."
msgstr "接到 `ctx.iconSvg` 的解析器 — 對於真實的圖示傳入 [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)，或在能證明呼叫者的元素集合絕不會呈現圖示時傳入 [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md)（參見 `ICON_ELEMENTS` 在 `./elements-meta.ts` 中的說明）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/createLocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Define the locale subset your app supports. Pass the imported bundle objects as an object\nwhose keys are the locale tags (JavaScript shorthand makes this natural). TypeScript narrows\nthe accepted locale tags to only the keys you provide."
msgstr "定義您的應用程式支援的語系子集。將匯入的 bundle 物件作為一個物件傳入\n其鍵為語系標籤（JavaScript 的簡寫使這一點很自然）。TypeScript 會將可接受的語系標籤\n縮窄為您所提供的鍵。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/createLocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Not calling `createLocaleSet` at all gives the full 44-locale barrel — use this factory only\nwhen you need compile-time validation or explicit tree-shaking signals."
msgstr "完全不呼叫 `createLocaleSet` 將會得到完整的 44 個語系 barrel — 僅在\n需要編譯時驗證或明確的 tree-shaking 訊號時使用此工廠。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/createLocaleSet.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`K` *extends* `string`"
msgstr "`K` *繼承* `string`"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/defineBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create and validate a [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md). Throws when required fields are missing or `locale`\nis not a non-empty string."
msgstr "建立並驗證一個 [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md)。當必要欄位遺失或 `locale`\n不是非空字串時會拋出錯誤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatDate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound date/time formatter."
msgstr "一個依據地區設定綁定的日期／時間格式化器。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatList.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound list formatter (e.g. `\"a, b, and c\"` in English, with correct conjunctions elsewhere)."
msgstr "依據語系的列表格式化器（例如英語中的 `\"a, b, and c\"`，在其他語言中會使用正確的連接詞）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatMessage.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Format an MF2 `source` message for `locale`, substituting `params`. Throws on invalid MF2 syntax\n— validate with `@pantoken/i18n-engine`'s `validateMf2` at build time, not at format time."
msgstr "將 MF2 `source` 訊息格式化為 `locale`，並替換 `params`。在 MF2 語法無效時拋出例外\n— 在建置時使用 `@pantoken/i18n-engine` 的 `validateMf2` 進行驗證，而不是在格式化時驗證。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatMessage.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`messageformat` already isolates each placeholder's formatted value in FSI/PDI bidi marks by\ndefault (its `bidiIsolation: \"default\"` option) — [isolate](isolate.md) is for interpolation done\nOUTSIDE of MF2 formatting, not needed here."
msgstr "`messageformat` 已預設（其 `bidiIsolation: \"default\"` 選項）使用 FSI/PDI 雙向標記將每個佔位符的格式化值隔離\n— [isolate](isolate.md) 用於在 MF2 格式化之外進行的插值，這裡不需要。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatNumber.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound number formatter (thousands separators, currency, percent, etc.)."
msgstr "區域設定綁定的數字格式化器（千位分隔符、貨幣、百分比等）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatRelativeTime.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A locale-bound relative-time formatter (e.g. `\"3 days ago\"`)."
msgstr "一個與語系綁定的相對時間格式化器（例如 `\"3 days ago\"`）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/getDir.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Return the text direction for a locale — using the [LOCALES](../variables/LOCALES.md) registry for known\nlocales, falling back to `\"ltr\"` for unknown tags."
msgstr "返回某一語言環境的文字方向 — 對已知\n語言環境使用 [LOCALES](../variables/LOCALES.md) 登錄表，對未知的標籤則回退為 `\"ltr\"`。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/isolate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap `value` in Unicode bidi isolates (FSI/PDI) so it doesn't scramble the surrounding text's\ndirection — e.g. a Latin filename embedded in an Arabic sentence built with plain string\nconcatenation. `formatMessage` already does this for MF2 placeholders; use `isolate` only when\ninterpolating outside MF2."
msgstr "將 `value` 包裹在 Unicode 雙向隔離（FSI/PDI）中，以免擾亂周圍文字的\n方向 — 例如在以純字串串接建立的阿拉伯語句子中嵌入的拉丁語檔名。 `formatMessage` 已\n經對 MF2 佔位符執行此操作；僅在 MF2 之外插值時才使用 `isolate`。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/makeStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a `WebComponentStrings` object for `locale`.\nWeekday names are derived from `Intl.DateTimeFormat` (and rotated to the locale's first day of\nweek); all other strings fall back to English unless provided in `overrides`."
msgstr "為 `locale` 構建一個 `WebComponentStrings` 物件。\n星期名稱取自 `Intl.DateTimeFormat`（並會旋轉至該地區的週首日\n）；所有其他字串若未在 `overrides` 中提供，則回退為英文。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/noopIconSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)-shaped resolver that never resolves anything — for elements that don't need it."
msgstr "一個以 [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) 形狀的解析器，從不解析任何內容 — 適用於不需要它的元素。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "接受一個已完全解析的 [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *或* 原始 BCP47 標籤字串。當傳入字串時， [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) 會透過 `Intl.DateTimeFormat` 推導出星期名稱，其他所有字串則回退為英文；如需完整翻譯請傳入一個 bundle。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "一個 [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) 物件，或一個 BCP47 標籤（`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/resolveFirstDay.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "First day of week as a JS `Date.getDay()` index (0=Sunday … 6=Saturday)."
msgstr "一週的第一天，作為 JS `Date.getDay()` 索引（0=星期日 … 6=星期六）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/web-components` — framework-agnostic custom elements for Instructure UI."
msgstr "`@pantoken/web-components` — 適用於 Instructure UI 的框架無關自訂元素。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invoked in the browser) defines the full `<instui-*>` element set into\nany custom-element registry. Each element renders the matching `@pantoken/components` CSS into\nits shadow root; tokens are inherited custom properties that pierce the shadow boundary — load\n`@pantoken/css` to supply them."
msgstr "[register](functions/register.md)（在瀏覽器中自動呼叫）將完整的 `<instui-*>` 元素集定義到任何自訂元素註冊表中。每個元素會將對應的 `@pantoken/components` CSS 呈現在其 shadow root；tokens 是穿透 shadow 邊界的繼承型自訂屬性 — 載入 `@pantoken/css` 以提供它們。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."
msgstr "對於本地化的 UI 字串（行事曆導航標籤、日期輸入的佔位文字、鑽取式的「返回」文字），將 `locale`、`strings` 或 `dir` 選項傳給 [register](functions/register.md)。完整的 Canvas 等效套件與 [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) 幫助器也由此套件匯出。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The module is Node-safe: element classes are defined inside [register](functions/register.md), a no-op when there\nis no DOM, so importing during SSR or a build never touches `HTMLElement`."
msgstr "此模組為 Node 安全：元素類別定義於 [register](functions/register.md) 內，當沒有 DOM 時為 no-op，因此在 SSR 或建置時匯入不會觸及 `HTMLElement`。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One registered custom element: its base tag name plus a `define` that registers it via the context."
msgstr "一個已註冊的自訂元素：其基礎標籤名稱，加上一個 `define`，透過上下文註冊它。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base tag name, e.g. `button` (minted to `<instui-button>`/`<x-button>` by the active prefix)."
msgstr "The base tag name, e.g. `button` (minted to `&lt;instui-button&gt;`/`&lt;x-button&gt;` by the active prefix)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementDefinition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register the element into `ctx.registry`, using only the shared, prefix-aware helpers."
msgstr "將該元素註冊到 `ctx.registry`，僅使用共用且具前綴感知的輔助函式。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/ElementRegistry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A minimal structural type for a custom-element registry (the DOM's `customElements`)."
msgstr "用於自訂元素註冊表的一個最小結構型別（DOM 的 `customElements`）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A fully resolved locale bundle: BCP47 tag, direction, display label, and translated strings."
msgstr "已完全解析的語系套件：BCP47 標籤、文字方向、顯示標籤，以及已翻譯的字串。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag (e.g. `\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, `\"zh-Hans\"`)."
msgstr "BCP47 語系標籤（例如 `\"hu\"`、`\"ar\"`、`\"zh-Hans\"`）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleInfo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text direction."
msgstr "文字方向。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable display label."
msgstr "可供人閱讀的顯示標籤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleBundle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated UI strings for the web-component element set."
msgstr "針對 web-component 元素集合的已翻譯 UI 字串。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleInfo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display label and text-direction metadata for a single locale."
msgstr "顯示單一語系的標籤與文字方向元資料。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleInfo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable label (English + native name where applicable)."
msgstr "可讀標籤（英文 + 適用時附上該語系的原文名稱）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A typed subset of [LocaleBundle](LocaleBundle.md)s. Created by [createLocaleSet](../functions/createLocaleSet.md) to constrain an\napp's supported locales at compile time — registering or retrieving a locale not in the set is a\nTypeScript error."
msgstr "一個經過型別限定的 [LocaleBundle](LocaleBundle.md) 子集。由 [createLocaleSet](../functions/createLocaleSet.md) 建立，用以在編譯時限制應用程式支援的語系 — 註冊或取用不在該集合中的語系會造成 TypeScript 錯誤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The locale tags included in this set."
msgstr "此集合中包含的語系標籤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Type guard — true when `locale` is in this set."
msgstr "型別守衛 — 當 `locale` 屬於此集合時回傳 true。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Return the bundle for `locale`. Throws at runtime when called with an unknown locale."
msgstr "回傳 `locale` 的 bundle。若以未知語系呼叫則於執行時拋出錯誤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Register `@pantoken/web-components` elements with the given locale from this set."
msgstr "使用此集合中的指定語系註冊 `@pantoken/web-components` 元素。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The shared state a `register()` call builds once and threads to every [ElementDefinition](ElementDefinition.md).\nIt carries the prefix-aware registry adapter, the `tag()` helper for nested markup, the CSS-class\nprefix `I`, the Invoker Commands support flag + router, the `wrapper`/`variantClass`/`iconSvg`\nfactories, and locale data (`strings`, `locale`, `dir`, `firstDay`)."
msgstr "由 `register()` 呼叫建立並傳遞到每個 [ElementDefinition](ElementDefinition.md) 的共用狀態。\n它攜帶支援前綴感知的註冊器適配器、用於巢狀標記的 `tag()` 幫助函式、CSS 類\n前綴 `I`、Invoker Commands 的支援旗標與路由器、`wrapper`/`variantClass`/`iconSvg`\n工廠，以及語系資料（`strings`, `locale`, `dir`, `firstDay`）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The scoped registry: rewrites `instui-<base>` → the active-prefix tag on `get`/`define`."
msgstr "The scoped registry: rewrites `instui-&lt;base&gt;` → the active-prefix tag on `get`/`define`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Map a base name to the active-prefix tag (for nested markup, `querySelector`, `tagName`)."
msgstr "將基底名稱對映到作用中前綴的標籤（用於巢狀標記，`querySelector`, `tagName`）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS-class prefix for the inlined component sheets — always `instui`, separate from the tag prefix."
msgstr "內嵌元件樣式表的 CSS 類前綴 — 永遠為 `instui`，與標籤前綴分離。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether the browser supports the Invoker Commands API (`command`/`commandfor`)."
msgstr "瀏覽器是否支援 Invoker Commands API（`command`/`commandfor`）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Route a target's `command` events (or a click fallback) to a handler."
msgstr "將目標的 `command` 事件（或點擊備援）路由到處理器。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Define a shadow-DOM element: `<style>:host{display}css</style>` + markup from `render(host)`.\n`invoker: true` forwards the host's `popovertarget`/`command` to the inner `<button>` (IDL)."
msgstr "Define a shadow-DOM element: `&lt;style&gt;:host{display}css&lt;/style&gt;` + markup from `render(host)`.\n`invoker: true` forwards the host's `popovertarget`/`command` to the inner `&lt;button&gt;` (IDL)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a `.instui-<name>` class with an optional `-color-<variant>` modifier from `variant`."
msgstr "Build a `.instui-&lt;name&gt;` class with an optional `-color-&lt;variant&gt;` modifier from `variant`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve an icon name to inline SVG (empty string when unknown)."
msgstr "將圖示名稱解析為內嵌 SVG（未知時回傳空字串）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "BCP47 locale tag used for `toLocaleDateString` and `Intl` formatting."
msgstr "用於 `toLocaleDateString` 與 `Intl` 格式化的 BCP47 語系標籤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text direction derived from the active locale bundle."
msgstr "從作用中語系包導出的文字方向。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "First day of week as JS `Date.getDay()` index (0=Sunday … 6=Saturday)."
msgstr "以 JS `Date.getDay()` 索引表示的一週第一天（0=星期日 … 6=星期六）。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/RegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated UI strings for all behavioral elements."
