#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/DEFINITIONS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every element definition, in the canonical registration order. The order is load-bearing:\n`date-input` renders a nested `calendar` and `date-time-input` renders a nested `date-input`, and\nthe `ELEMENTS` tuple / the register-order test both derive from this list."
msgstr "每個元素定義，以典範的註冊順序。此順序為負載關鍵：\n`date-input` 呈現一個巢狀的 `calendar`，而 `date-time-input` 呈現一個巢狀的 `date-input`，且\n`ELEMENTS` 元組 / the register-order test 皆衍生自此清單。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ELEMENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\nunder its `prefix` option — `icon` → `<instui-icon>` by default, or `<x-icon>` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\nA prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so an empty or nullish prefix\nfalls back to the default `instui`."
msgstr "The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\nunder its `prefix` option — `icon` → `&lt;instui-icon&gt;` by default, or `&lt;x-icon&gt;` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\nA prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so an empty or nullish prefix\nfalls back to the default `instui`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ENGLISH_STRINGS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "English defaults used when no locale bundle is provided."
msgstr "當未提供語系套件時，使用英文預設值。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/ICON_ELEMENTS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Base element names that actually call [iconSvg](../functions/iconSvg.md) to render an inline glyph, as opposed to the\nseparate, CSS-only `-icon-<name>` glyph painting most components use (a mask on a CSS custom\nproperty, no JS resolution involved). `date-time-input` isn't listed because it doesn't call\n`iconSvg` itself — it nests `date-input`/`calendar` (see [NESTED\\_DEPS](NESTED_DEPS.md)), which do."
msgstr "Base element names that actually call [iconSvg](../functions/iconSvg.md) to render an inline glyph, as opposed to the\nseparate, CSS-only `-icon-&lt;name&gt;` glyph painting most components use (a mask on a CSS custom\nproperty, no JS resolution involved). `date-time-input` isn't listed because it doesn't call\n`iconSvg` itself — it nests `date-input`/`calendar` (see [NESTED\\_DEPS](NESTED_DEPS.md)), which do."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/LOCALES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "All 44 supported locales keyed by BCP47 tag, with direction and display label."
msgstr "所有 44 個受支援的語言環境，以 BCP47 標籤作為鍵，並包含方向與顯示標籤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/NESTED_DEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Elements whose shadow markup renders another element, so registering one requires its dependencies\ntoo: `<instui-date-time-input>` renders a `<instui-date-input>`, which renders a `<instui-calendar>`.\n[register](../functions/register.md)'s `only` filter expands through this (transitively) so a cherry-picked subset still\nworks. Keyed by base name; values are direct dependencies."
msgstr "Elements whose shadow markup renders another element, so registering one requires its dependencies\ntoo: `&lt;instui-date-time-input&gt;` renders a `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;`, which renders a `&lt;instui-calendar&gt;`.\n[register](../functions/register.md)'s `only` filter expands through this (transitively) so a cherry-picked subset still\nworks. Keyed by base name; values are direct dependencies."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/alert.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-alert>` — an inline status message with `role=\"alert\"`. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-<variant>` modifier (`info`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`). Alerts are elevated by default;\nset `has-shadow=\"false\"` to flatten one (→ `-without-shadow`, mirroring InstUI's `hasShadow={false}`).\nThe `timeout` attribute (milliseconds) auto-dismisses the alert after that delay — it fades out,\nremoves itself from the DOM, and fires a cancelable bubbling `dismiss` event (call `preventDefault()`\non it to keep the alert mounted). The fade states use `@pantoken/components`' `transition` utility;\nload its stylesheet when using timeout dismissal. Slotted content is the message body."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-alert&gt;` — an inline status message with `role=\"alert\"`. The `variant` attribute maps to the\n`-color-&lt;variant&gt;` modifier (`info`, `success`, `warning`, `danger`). Alerts are elevated by default;\nset `has-shadow=\"false\"` to flatten one (→ `-without-shadow`, mirroring InstUI's `hasShadow={false}`).\nThe `timeout` attribute (milliseconds) auto-dismisses the alert after that delay — it fades out,\nremoves itself from the DOM, and fires a cancelable bubbling `dismiss` event (call `preventDefault()`\non it to keep the alert mounted). The fade states use `@pantoken/components`' `transition` utility;\nload its stylesheet when using timeout dismissal. Slotted content is the message body."

