msgid "`<instui-avatar>` — a circular (or rectangular) avatar. `variant` maps to `-color-<variant>`,\n`size` to `-size-<size>`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-rectangle`; slotted content is the\ninitials, or an `<img>` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-avatar&gt;` — a circular (or rectangular) avatar. `variant` maps to `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`,\n`size` to `-size-&lt;size&gt;`, and `shape=\"rectangle\"` to `-shape-rectangle`; slotted content is the\ninitials, or an `&lt;img&gt;` (use an absolute/CDN `src`) to show a photo."

