msgstr "丹麥語（Dansk）語系套件。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/dateInput.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-date-input>` — a text field plus a calendar dropdown. The trigger toggles a `[popover]`\nthrough the built-in `toggle-popover` Invoker Command (a click fallback covers browsers without the\nAPI); picking a day in the nested `<instui-calendar>` fills the field (ISO `yyyy-mm-dd`), closes the\npopover, and emits a composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Typing a valid `yyyy-mm-dd` (or\nclearing it) and committing on the input's `change` works too. `value` is the ISO date, `label` the\naccessible name (default `Date`), and `placeholder` the hint (default `yyyy-mm-dd`)."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-date-input&gt;` — a text field plus a calendar dropdown. The trigger toggles a `[popover]`\nthrough the built-in `toggle-popover` Invoker Command (a click fallback covers browsers without the\nAPI); picking a day in the nested `&lt;instui-calendar&gt;` fills the field (ISO `yyyy-mm-dd`), closes the\npopover, and emits a composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Typing a valid `yyyy-mm-dd` (or\nclearing it) and committing on the input's `change` works too. `value` is the ISO date, `label` the\naccessible name (default `Date`), and `placeholder` the hint (default `yyyy-mm-dd`)."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/dateTimeInput.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-date-time-input>` — a nested `<instui-date-input>` plus a native time field. A change to\neither recomputes a combined `value` (`yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm`, or just the date when no time) and emits\na composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Setting `value` splits it back across the two\nfields."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-date-time-input&gt;` — a nested `&lt;instui-date-input&gt;` plus a native time field. A change to\neither recomputes a combined `value` (`yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm`, or just the date when no time) and emits\na composed, bubbling `change` (`detail.value`). Setting `value` splits it back across the two\nfields."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/de.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "German (Deutsch) locale bundle."
msgstr "德語 (Deutsch) 語系套件。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/drawerLayout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-drawer-layout>` — a side tray plus main content area. The `open` attribute reveals the\ntray; `placement` (`start`|`end`) picks the side. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands:\n`<button command=\"--toggle|--open|--close\" commandfor=\"drawer-id\">`. Content goes in the default\nslot; the tray in `slot=\"tray\"`. The interactions behavior auto-toggles overlay mode based on the\n`--pantoken-bp-md` threshold."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-drawer-layout&gt;` — a side tray plus main content area. The `open` attribute reveals the\ntray; `placement` (`start`|`end`) picks the side. Drivable from light DOM via Invoker Commands:\n`<button command=\"--toggle|--open|--close\" commandfor=\"drawer-id\">`. Content goes in the default\nslot; the tray in `slot=\"tray\"`. The interactions behavior auto-toggles overlay mode based on the\n`--pantoken-bp-md` threshold."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/drawerLayout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content pane carries `role=\"region\"`, matching InstUI's DrawerLayout; label it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when the surrounding context doesn't already name it."
msgstr "內容窗格帶有 `role=\"region\"`，與 InstUI 的 DrawerLayout 相符；當周遭語境尚未為其命名時，請以 `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` 為其標籤。"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/drawerLayout.md
