#: tools/aggregate/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The aggregator for the unified `pantoken` meta package. It scans the meta package's dependencies\nfor the `pantoken` field, then generates the barrel (`export * as <key> from \"<pkg>\"`), one\nsubpath entry file per target, and the meta `package.json` `exports` map — so adding a new target\npackage with a `pantoken` field auto-registers it, with no manual barrel edits."
msgstr "The aggregator for the unified `pantoken` meta package. It scans the meta package's dependencies\nfor the `pantoken` field, then generates the barrel (`export * as &lt;key&gt; from \"&lt;pkg&gt;\"`), one\nsubpath entry file per target, and the meta `package.json` `exports` map — so adding a new target\npackage with a `pantoken` field auto-registers it, with no manual barrel edits."

