#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A target discovered by its `pantoken` field."
msgstr "透過其 `pantoken` 欄位發現的目標。"

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The package name, e.g. `@pantoken/astro`."
msgstr "套件名稱，例如 `@pantoken/astro`。"

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The aggregation key / export name, e.g. `astro`."
msgstr "聚合鍵 / 匯出名稱，例如 `astro`。"

#: tools/aggregate/src/interfaces/Target.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How the target is exposed:\n- `namespace` — re-exported into the eager barrel *and* as a subpath.\n- `sideEffect` — subpath imports the package's `/inject` entry; also in the barrel.\n- `subpath` — subpath only, kept OUT of the eager barrel (for heavy peers like React, so\n  `import \"pantoken\"` never loads them)."
msgstr "目標的暴露方式：\n- `namespace` — 重新匯出到 eager barrel，並且作為子路徑。\n- `sideEffect` — 子路徑會匯入套件的 `/inject` 入口；同時也在 barrel 中。\n- `subpath` — 僅限子路徑，排除於 eager barrel（針對像 React 這類重量級同伴，\n  以避免 `import \"pantoken\"` 載入它們）。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the full `<!doctype html>` document string for an isolated live-example preview."
msgstr "為獨立的即時範例預覽構建完整的 `<!doctype html>` 文件字串。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The example's raw markup (verbatim from its source fence)."
msgstr "範例的原始標記（逐字取自其來源程式區塊）。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The document string — pass it through [escapeSrcdoc](escapeSrcdoc.md) before using it as an iframe\n`srcdoc` attribute value."
msgstr "文件字串 — 在將其用作 iframe\n`srcdoc` 屬性值之前，先透過 [escapeSrcdoc](escapeSrcdoc.md) 處理。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/demoMarkdownIt.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A markdown-it plugin: turn `demo` fences into the demo panel. Use it with\n`md.use(demoMarkdownIt, options)`."
msgstr "一個 markdown-it 外掛：將 `demo` 圍欄轉換為示範面板。與\n`md.use(demoMarkdownIt, options)` 一起使用。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/escapeSrcdoc.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Escape a string for embedding inside an HTML attribute value delimited by `\"`."
msgstr "轉義字串以嵌入於由 `\"` 所界定的 HTML 屬性值中。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/renderDemoFigure.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render the demo panel HTML for a resolved demo: a bare, sandboxed, lazy-loaded iframe framed like a\nlive example (no host chrome — the runner inside carries its own tab toolbar). Style it with\n`@pantoken/demo/demo.css`."
msgstr "為已解析的示例渲染 demo 面板的 HTML：一個簡潔、受沙箱保護、延遲加載的 iframe，呈現為類似實時範例的框架（沒有主機外殼 — 執行器內部自帶分頁工具列）。使用 `@pantoken/demo/demo.css` 來為其設計樣式。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/renderDemoFigure.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ResolvedDemo](../interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md)."
msgstr "一個 [ResolvedDemo](../interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md)。"

#: tools/demo/src/functions/renderDemoFigure.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The panel HTML string."
msgstr "面板的 HTML 字串。"

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/demo` — the render side of the `@demo` system."
msgstr "`@pantoken/demo` — `@demo` 系統的呈現端。"

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` turns a `@demo <spec>` tag into a fenced `demo` block whose\nbody is the spec (a bare URL or a `<provider>:<ref>` pair). This package resolves that spec into an\nembeddable iframe and renders the surrounding panel — an MDN-style \"live sample.\""
msgstr "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` turns a `@demo &lt;spec&gt;` tag into a fenced `demo` block whose\nbody is the spec (a bare URL or a `&lt;provider&gt;:&lt;ref&gt;` pair). This package resolves that spec into an\nembeddable iframe and renders the surrounding panel — an MDN-style \"live sample.\""

#: tools/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships three things: [resolveDemo](functions/resolveDemo.md) (spec → iframe attributes, framework-agnostic), a\nmarkdown-it plugin ([demoMarkdownIt](functions/demoMarkdownIt.md)) that turns `demo` fences into the panel HTML, and a\nself-hosted runner (`@pantoken/demo/runner.html`) — a same-origin page that fetches a bare\nHTML/CSS/JS demo and renders it with your token stylesheets injected, so `self:` demos need no\nthird-party account and no framing workarounds."
msgstr "它包含三個部分： [resolveDemo](functions/resolveDemo.md) (spec → iframe 屬性、與框架無關)，一個\nmarkdown-it 外掛（[demoMarkdownIt](functions/demoMarkdownIt.md)），將 `demo` 代碼區塊轉換成面板的 HTML，以及一個\n自我託管的執行器（`@pantoken/demo/runner.html`）— 一個同源頁面，會擷取裸 HTML/CSS/JS 範例並在注入你的 token 樣式表後進行渲染，因此 `self:` 範例不需要第三方帳號或任何關於 framing 的變通方法。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [demoMarkdownIt](../functions/demoMarkdownIt.md): the [resolveDemo](../functions/resolveDemo.md) fields plus optional live-example seaming."
msgstr "為 [demoMarkdownIt](../functions/demoMarkdownIt.md) 的選項：[resolveDemo](../functions/resolveDemo.md) 欄位，以及可選的即時範例接合。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Site base path, e.g. `/pantoken/` (default `/`)."
msgstr "網站基底路徑，例如 `/pantoken/`（預設 `/`）。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Runner page path, relative to `base` (default `play/index.html`)."
msgstr "Runner 頁面路徑，相對於 `base`（預設 `play/index.html`）。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Self-hosted demo-source dir, relative to `base` (default `demos/`)."
msgstr "自我託管的 demo 原始碼目錄，相對於 `base`（預設 `demos/`）。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stylesheet URLs the runner injects (into its chrome and every rendered result): the component\nsheets, the multi-theme token sheet, and the plugin/surface sheets. The runner themes by toggling\nthe `data-pantoken-theme` attribute, so one token sheet covers every theme."
msgstr "Runner 注入的樣式表 URL（注入其 chrome 以及每個呈現結果）：元件\n樣式表、多主題代幣樣式表，以及外掛/表面樣式表。Runner 透過切換\n`data-pantoken-theme` 屬性來切換主題，因此一個代幣樣式表即可涵蓋所有主題。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Localized [RunnerLabels](RunnerLabels.md) for the runner's view tabs, forwarded in the runner URL."
msgstr "本地化的 [RunnerLabels](RunnerLabels.md) 用於 runner 的檢視分頁，會在 runner URL 中轉發。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When set, appends a live preview after each `html` fence on matching pages — the same markup,\nrendered live, beneath its source. Overlay examples (`<dialog>`, `[popover]`) are skipped: they're\nhidden until opened, so a `## Demo` iframe drives their preview instead."
msgstr "When set, appends a live preview after each `html` fence on matching pages — the same markup,\nrendered live, beneath its source. Overlay examples (`&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`) are skipped: they're\nhidden until opened, so a `## Demo` iframe drives their preview instead."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Route a `demo:self:<name>` fence to a locale-specific self-hosted demo directory, from the current\npage's markdown-it `env.relativePath` (e.g. `\"hu/\"` for pages under `hu/`, `\"\"` for the root\nlocale). Prepended to `demosPath` so the localized clone of a demo (translated prose, same markup)\nloads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."
msgstr "Route a `demo:self:&lt;name&gt;` fence to a locale-specific self-hosted demo directory, from the current\npage's markdown-it `env.relativePath` (e.g. `\"hu/\"` for pages under `hu/`, `\"\"` for the root\nlocale). Prepended to `demosPath` so the localized clone of a demo (translated prose, same markup)\nloads instead of the English source. Omit for a single-locale site."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/DemoMarkdownItOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Resolve the runner's view-tab labels for the current page, from its markdown-it `env.relativePath`\n— the same locale lookup as [DemoMarkdownItOptions.localePrefix](#localeprefix). Omit for a single-locale\nsite (the runner then shows its English defaults)."
msgstr "解析 runner 的檢視分頁標籤（針對當前頁面），來源為其 markdown-it `env.relativePath`\n\n— 與 [DemoMarkdownItOptions.localePrefix](#localeprefix) 相同的語系查找。對於單一語系\n\nsite（此時 runner 會顯示其英文預設值)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildExampleSrcdoc](../functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md)."
msgstr "針對 [buildExampleSrcdoc](../functions/buildExampleSrcdoc.md) 的選項。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stylesheet URLs to load into the iframe's `<head>` (tokens, components, utilities, icons, …)."
msgstr "Stylesheet URLs to load into the iframe's `&lt;head&gt;` (tokens, components, utilities, icons, …)."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap `html` in the shared `.instui-card` surface (default `true`)."
msgstr "將 `html` 包裝在共用的 `.instui-card` 介面中（預設為 `true`）。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ExampleSrcdocOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text direction for the isolated document's `<html>` (default `\"ltr\"`) — a srcdoc never inherits it from the embedding page."
msgstr "Text direction for the isolated document's `&lt;html&gt;` (default `\"ltr\"`) — a srcdoc never inherits it from the embedding page."

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/LiveExampleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "How to seam a live preview onto each `@example` HTML fence on matching pages."
msgstr "如何在相符的頁面，將即時預覽接到每個 `@example` HTML 程式碼區塊上。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/LiveExampleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only wrap fences on pages whose markdown-it `env.relativePath` matches (e.g. the CSS-API pages)."
msgstr "僅在其 markdown-it `env.relativePath` 符合的頁面上包裹程式碼區塊（例如 CSS-API 頁面）。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/LiveExampleOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the preview block appended after each non-overlay `html` fence, from its markup, any `-flag` tokens parsed from the fence info string, and the page's `env.relativePath` (for locale/direction lookups)."
msgstr "從該區塊的標記、從 fence info 字串解析出的任何 `-flag` 令牌，以及頁面的 `env.relativePath`（用於區域/文字方向查找），建立並附加於每個非覆蓋型 `html` 程式碼區塊之後的預覽區塊。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolveOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for resolving a demo spec. Only the `self` provider uses the runner/demos/css fields."
msgstr "解析範例規格的選項。只有 `self` 提供者會使用 runner/demos/css 欄位。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A resolved demo: iframe attributes plus the provider that produced them."
msgstr "已解析的示例：iframe 屬性以及產生這些屬性的提供者。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The provider that produced the embed (`url`, `self`, `stackblitz`, …)."
msgstr "產生該嵌入內容的提供者（`url`, `self`, `stackblitz`, …）。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/ResolvedDemo.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
