#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The runner's view-tab labels. Omitted keys fall back to the runner's English defaults."
msgstr "runner 的檢視分頁標籤。省略的鍵會回退到 runner 的英文預設值。"

#: tools/demo/src/interfaces/RunnerLabels.md
#, no-c-format
